msgid "Community"
msgstr "Gemenskap"

#: content/contents.lr:page.subtitle https://community.torproject.org/
msgid "Our community is made up of human rights defenders around the world."
msgstr "Vår gemenskap består av människorättsförsvarare runt om i världen."

#: content/contents.lr:page.title https://community.torproject.org/
msgid "Join the Tor Community"
msgstr "Bli en del av Tor-gemenskapen"

#: content/gsoc/contents.lr:page.body https://community.torproject.org/gsoc/
msgid ""
"Each year we gather ideas for GSoC on our [Google Summer of Code's wiki page]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/team/-/wikis/GSoC)."
msgstr ""
"Varje år samlar vi idéer inför GSoC på vår [Google Summer of Code's wikisida]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/team/-/wikis/GSoC)."

#: content/gsoc/contents.lr:page.body https://community.torproject.org/gsoc/
msgid ""
"None of these ideas seem appealing? You may also want to propose your own "
"project idea — which often results in the best projects."
msgstr ""
"Tilltalar inget av förslagen dig? Du kan också föreslå en egen projektidé – "
"sådana blir ofta de bästa projekten."

#: content/gsoc/contents.lr:page.body https://community.torproject.org/gsoc/
msgid ""
"You can see some successful projects which have been implemented in the past "
"by Google Summer of Code and Outreachy participants on [our wiki](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/team/-/wikis/gsoc-previous-years)."
msgstr ""
"You can see some successful projects which have been implemented in the past "
"by Google Summer of Code and Outreachy participants on\n"
"\n"
"Du kan se några framgångsrika projekt som har blivit implementerade tidigare "
"på Google Summer of Code och Outreachydeltagare på [vår wiki](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/team/-/wikis/gsoc-previous-years)."

#: content/gsoc/contents.lr:page.body https://community.torproject.org/gsoc/
msgid ""
"You may find some of these projects to be good ideas for Google Summer of "
"Code. We have labeled each idea with which of our core developers would be "
"good mentors. If one or more of these ideas look promising to you, please "
"[contact us](mailto:gsoc@torproject.org) to discuss your plans rather than "
"sending blind applications."
msgstr ""
"Du kanske tycker att några av de här projekten är bra idéer för Google "
"Summer of Code. Vi har märkt varje idé med vilka av våra kärnutvecklare som "
"skulle vara bra mentorer. Om en eller flera av dessa idéer verkar lovande "
"för dig, vänligen [kontakta oss](mailto:gsoc@torproject.org) för att "
"diskutera dina planer i stället för att skicka blinda ansökningar."

#: content/gsoc/contents.lr:page.body https://community.torproject.org/gsoc/
msgid ""
"[We invite you to contact us to discuss your own project idea]"
"(mailto:gsoc@torproject.org)."
msgstr ""
"[Kontakta oss gärna för att diskutera en egen projektidé]"
"(mailto:gsoc@torproject.org)."

#: content/gsoc/contents.lr:page.cta https://community.torproject.org/gsoc/
msgid "Get coding"
msgstr "Börja koda"

#: content/gsoc/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/gsoc/
msgid "GSoC in Tor Project"
msgstr "GSoC inom The Tor Project"

#: content/gsoc/contents.lr:page.title https://community.torproject.org/gsoc/
msgid "Google Summer of Code"
msgstr "Google Summer of Code"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"![Watch Tor Project in Weblate](/static/images/localization/watch-"
"projects.png \"class='img-fluid'\")."
msgstr ""
"![Följ The Tor Project i Weblate](/static/images/localization/watch-"
"projects.png \"class='img-fluid'\")."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"![Weblate dashboard](/static/images/localization/weblate-dashboard.png "
"\"class='img-fluid'\")."
msgstr ""
"![Weblate dashboard](/static/images/localization/weblate-dashboard.png "
"\"class='img-fluid'\")."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"1. Activate your account by clicking on the email from weblate, agreeing to "
"the terms of service, and adding a new password."
msgstr ""
"1. Aktivera ditt konto genom att klicka på e-postmeddelandet från weblate, "
"vilket innebär att du godkänner användarvillkoren och lägger till ett nytt "
"lösenord."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"1. Fill out the next page with your information, and wait for the "
"confirmation email (it can take up to 10 minutes to arrive to your inbox)."
msgstr ""
"1. Fyll i dina uppgifter på nästa sida och vänta på bekräftelsemeddelandet "
"(det kan ta upp till 10 minuter innan det kommer till din inkorg)."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"1. Go to [Notifications](https://hosted.weblate.org/accounts/profile/"
"#notifications) and select `Tor Project` from watched projects."
msgstr ""
"1. Gå till [Aviseringar](https://hosted.weblate.org/accounts/profile/"
"#notifications) och välj `Tor Project` bland bevakade projekt."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"1. Head over to the [weblate signup page](https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"accounts/register/)."
msgstr ""
"1. Gå till [weblates registreringssida](https://hosted.weblate.org/accounts/"
"register/)."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"1. Make sure to also select [notifications for your watched projects]"
"(https://hosted.weblate.org/accounts/profile/#notifications)."
msgstr ""
"1. Se till att även välja [aviseringar för dina bevakade projekt](https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/accounts/profile/#notifications)."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"1. Now you will see the Tor Project translations on your [weblate dashboard]"
"(https://hosted.weblate.org/):"
msgstr ""
"1. Nu visas The Tor Projects översättningar på din [Weblate-instrumentpanel]"
"(https://hosted.weblate.org/):"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"1. On the next page, select the languages you will translate to from the "
"menu, and save."
msgstr ""
"1. På nästa sida väljer du de språk du vill översätta till från menyn och "
"spara."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"Before translating, please read through the Tor Project page on the "
"[Localization Lab Wiki](https://wiki.localizationlab.org/index.php/Tor), and "
"our documentation at the [Tor L10n wiki for translators](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/wikis/Localization-for-"
"translators) and [reviewers](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/"
"l10n/-/wikis/Localization-for-reviewers)."
msgstr ""
"Innan du översätter, läs igenom Tor Projects sida på [Localization Lab Wiki]"
"(https://wiki.localizationlab.org/index.php/Tor), och vår dokumentation på "
"[Tor L10n wiki för översättare](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/"
"l10n/-/wikis/Localization-for-translators) och [granskare](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/wikis/Localization-for-reviewers)."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "IRC channel"
msgstr "IRC-kanal"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "Localization mailing list"
msgstr "Lokaliserings e-postlista"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"Most of our localization efforts are hosted on [weblate](https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/projects/tor/), a third-party translation platform."
msgstr ""
"Merparten av våra lokaliseringsinsatser finns på [weblate](https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/projects/tor/), en tredjepartsplattform för översättning."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "Other projects we recommend are Guardian Project and Onionshare:"
msgstr "Andra projekt vi rekommenderar är Guardian Project och Onionshare:"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"Our localization efforts are supported by the [Localization Lab](https://"
"www.localizationlab.org/)."
msgstr ""
"Våra lokaliseringsarbeten stöds av [Localization Lab](https://"
"www.localizationlab.org/)."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "Registering on Weblate"
msgstr "Registrering på Weblate"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"Remember that the username and email address you choose will be publicly "
"visible on the translation platform since they will be associated with the "
"changes you make."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att användarnamnet och e-postadressen som du väljer visas "
"offentligt på översättningsplattformen eftersom de kopplas till dina "
"ändringar."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "Thank you for your interest in helping us with translations."
msgstr "Tack för ditt intresse av att hjälpa oss med översättningar."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"The page includes guidelines, resources, and priorities that will help you "
"make the most out of your contribution."
msgstr ""
"Sidan innehåller riktlinjer, resurser och prioriteringar som hjälper dig att "
"få ut det mesta av ditt bidrag."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"To communicate with other translators, please join the [Tor localization "
"mailing list](https://lists.torproject.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/tor-"
"l10n), where we organize translations, take decisions, report errors in "
"source strings, etc. Please introduce yourself and ask any questions you may "
"have after following up these instructions."
msgstr ""
"För att kommunicera med andra översättare, gå med i [Tor-lokaliserings-e-"
"postlistan](https://lists.torproject.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/tor-l10n), "
"där vi organiserar översättningar, fattar beslut, rapporterar fel i "
"källkodssträngar etc. Presentera dig själv och ställ eventuella frågor du "
"kan ha efter att ha följt dessa instruktioner."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "Translation platform"
msgstr "Översättningsplattform"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "We encourage the use of pseudonymous accounts."
msgstr "Vi uppmuntrar användningen av pseudonyma konton."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"We hang out in the #tor-l10n channel on the oftc IRC network. Please [join "
"us to talk about localization](https://support.torproject.org/get-in-touch/"
"#irc-help) (l10n)!"
msgstr ""
"Vi hänger i #tor-l10n-kanalen på oftacs IRC-nätverk. [Följ med oss och prata "
"om lokalisering](https://support.torproject.org/get-in-touch/#irc-help) "
"(l10n)!"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "What to translate first?"
msgstr "Vad ska översättas först?"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"You can also use Element https://element.io/ to connect: #tor-"
"l10n:matrix.org."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda Element https://element.io/ för att ansluta: #tor-"
"l10n:matrix.org."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"You can see the translations with more priority at our [translation "
"statistics page](https://tpo.pages.torproject.net/community/l10n/"
"stats.html#high-priority-translations)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan se översättningarna med högst prioritet på vår [sida med "
"översättningsstatistik](https://tpo.pages.torproject.net/community/l10n/"
"stats.html#high-priority-translations)."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid ""
"You can submit anonymous suggestions, but it is better to create an account "
"so you can comment and discuss with other translators, or review their "
"contributions."
msgstr ""
"Du kan skicka in anonyma förslag, men det är bättre att skapa ett konto så "
"att du kan kommentera och diskutera med andra översättare, eller granska "
"deras bidrag."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.section
#: content/localization/contents.lr:page.title
#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.section
#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.section
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid "Localization"
msgstr "Översättning"

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "Learn how to sign up and begin contributing."
msgstr "Lär dig hur du registrerar dig och börjar bidra."

#: content/localization/becoming-tor-translator/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/
msgid "Becoming a Tor translator"
msgstr "Bli Tor-översättare"

#: content/localization/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/
msgid ""
"In order for Tor to work for everyone, it needs to speak everyone's "
"languages."
msgstr "För att Tor ska fungera för alla måste det tala allas språk."

#: content/localization/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/
msgid "Localization is how we reach a global community."
msgstr "Lokalisering är hur vi når en global gemenskap."

#: content/localization/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/
msgid ""
"Our current translation priorities are translating [Tor Browser](https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/projects/tor/tor-browser/), Tor Browser documentation, "
"and the [Tor Project website](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/tor/tpo-"
"web/), but we aim to have all our websites and applications translated as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"Våra nuvarande översättningsprioriteringar är [Tor Browser](https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/projects/tor/tor-browser/), dokumentationen för Tor "
"Browser och [The Tor Projects webbplats](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/"
"tor/tpo-web/), men vårt mål är att även översätta alla våra andra "
"webbplatser och program."

#: content/localization/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/
msgid ""
"Our volunteer translation team works hard to make this a reality, and we can "
"always use more help."
msgstr ""
"Vårt frivilliga översättningsteam arbetar hårt för att göra detta till "
"verklighet, och vi kan alltid behöva mer hjälp."

#: content/localization/contents.lr:page.cta
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/
msgid "Help us translate"
msgstr "Hjälp oss översätta"

#: content/localization/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/
msgid ""
"We want Tor to work for everyone in the world, which means our software must "
"be translated into a lot of languages."
msgstr ""
"Vi vill att Tor ska fungera för alla i världen, vilket innebär att "
"programvaran måste översättas till många språk."

#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
msgid ""
"Our translations are incomplete for a lot of languages. They may be spoken "
"by fewer people around the world, but it is still critical that we improve "
"access to Tor for people who do not speak English."
msgstr ""
"Våra översättningar är ofullständiga för många språk. De må talas av färre "
"människor runt om i världen, men det är fortfarande viktigt att vi "
"förbättrar tillgången till Tor för personer som inte talar engelska."

#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
msgid ""
"Some languages are more active than others with a higher number of active "
"and committed contributors. However you are still welcome to help us with "
"these languages, even after the translations are complete."
msgstr ""
"Vissa språk är mer aktiva än andra med ett högre antal aktiva och engagerade "
"bidragsgivare. Du är dock fortfarande välkommen att hjälpa oss med dessa "
"språk, även efter att översättningarna är klara."

#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
msgid "These statistics are calculated daily."
msgstr "Denna statistik beräknas dagligen."

#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
msgid ""
"To learn more about the different files in translation, please consult [our "
"wiki section for translators](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/"
"l10n/-/wikis/Localization-for-translators)"
msgstr ""
"För att lära dig mer om de olika filerna som översätts, se [vår wiki-sektion "
"för översättare](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/wikis/"
"Localization-for-translators)"

#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
msgid ""
"We have statistics about our translations at the [L10n statistics page]"
"(https://tpo.pages.torproject.net/community/l10n/stats.html), with "
"information about priority translations and released translations."
msgstr ""
"Vi har statistik om våra översättningar på [L10ns statistiksida](https://"
"tpo.pages.torproject.net/community/l10n/stats.html), med information om "
"prioriterade översättningar och publicerade översättningar."

#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
msgid ""
"You can see the open tickets about translation issues on our [bugtracker]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/issues)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan se öppna ärenden om översättningsproblem på vår [buggtracker](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/issues)."

#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
msgid ""
"Not sure where to start? Here you can find an overview of the current "
"localization status for all of the different Tor Project projects."
msgstr ""
"Är du osäker på var du ska börja? Här hittar du en översikt över den "
"aktuella lokaliseringsstatusen för alla olika Tor-projekt."

#: content/localization/current-status/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/current-status/
msgid "Current Status of Translations"
msgstr "Aktuell översättningsstatus"

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"Before opening a ticket, see the currently [open tickets for Translations]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/issues?"
"scope=all&state=opened) because maybe it is already reported."
msgstr ""
"Innan du öppnar ett ärende, se de för närvarande [öppna ärenden för "
"översättningar](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/issues?"
"scope=all&state=opened) eftersom det kanske redan är rapporterat."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"If you are already a [Tor translator](../becoming-tor-translator), you can "
"simply find the string and fix it in [weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"projects/tor/#search)."
msgstr ""
"Om du redan är en [Tor-översättare](../becoming-tor-translator) kan du helt "
"enkelt hitta strängen och åtgärda den i [weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"projects/tor/#search)."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"If you find many errors on a translation, please consider [contributing to "
"our translations](../becoming-tor-translator/)."
msgstr ""
"Om du hittar många fel i en översättning, överväg gärna att [bidra till våra "
"översättningar](../becoming-tor-translator/)."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"If you see other problem with translations, you can [open a ticket on our "
"Bugtracker](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/issues?"
"scope=all&state=opened)."
msgstr ""
"Om du hittar andra översättningsproblem kan du [öppna ett ärende i vår "
"felspårare](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/community/l10n/-/issues?"
"scope=all&state=opened)."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"Our translations are done by volunteers, and sometimes there may be errors."
msgstr ""
"Våra översättningar görs av volontärer, och ibland kan det förekomma fel."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid "Reporting an error with a translation"
msgstr "Rapportera ett fel med en översättning"

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"We always need help on improving our translations, and as our websites "
"change translations become outdated."
msgstr ""
"Vi behöver alltid hjälp med att förbättra våra översättningar, och allt "
"eftersom våra webbplatser ändras blir översättningar föråldrade."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/user-research/become-tester/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
#: https://community.torproject.org/user-research/become-tester/
msgid ""
"You can also submit GitLab issues anonymously using [Anonticket](https://"
"anonticket.onionize.space)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan även skicka GitLab-ärenden anonymt via [Anonticket](https://"
"anonticket.onionize.space)."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"You can report such issues on [irc](https://support.torproject.org/get-in-"
"touch/#irc-help), on the #tor-l10n channel on the oftc network (you may need "
"to be registered to log in)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan rapportera sådana problem via [IRC](https://support.torproject.org/"
"get-in-touch/#irc-help), i kanalen #tor-l10n på OFTC-nätverket. Du kan "
"behöva registrera dig för att logga in."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"You can send an email to the [tor localization mailing list](https://"
"lists.torproject.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/tor-l10n)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan skicka e-post till [Tors e-postlista för lokalisering](https://"
"lists.torproject.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/tor-l10n)."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"You can start a topic on the [Localization Feedback section of the Tor Forum]"
"(https://forum.torproject.org/c/feedback/localization-feedback/8)"
msgstr ""
"Du kan starta ett ämne i [lokaliseringsåterkoppling-sektionen i Tor-forumet]"
"(https://forum.torproject.org/c/feedback/localization-feedback/8)"

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid ""
"Sometimes the translations of apps are not working correctly. Here you can "
"learn to fix it."
msgstr ""
"Ibland fungerar inte översättningarna av appar korrekt. Här kan du lära dig "
"att åtgärda det."

#: content/localization/translation-problem/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/localization/translation-problem/
msgid "Report a problem with a translation"
msgstr "Rapportera ett översättningsproblem"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"**Important:** Revoking a client can be done by removing their \".auth\" "
"file, however the revocation will be in effect only after the tor process "
"gets restarted."
msgstr ""
"**Viktigt:** En klient kan återkallas genom att ta bort deras \".auth\"-fil. "
"Återkallelsen träder dock i kraft först efter att tor-processen har startats "
"om."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"**Note:** Once you have configured client authorization, anyone with the "
"address will not be able to access it from this point on."
msgstr ""
"**Obs!** När du har konfigurerat klientauktorisering kommer ingen med "
"adressen att kunna komma åt den från och med nu."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "**Private key**"
msgstr "**Privat nyckel**"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "**Public key**"
msgstr "**Publik nyckel**"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "**Step 1.** Generate a key using the algorithm x25519:"
msgstr "**Steg 1.** Generera en nyckel med algoritmen x25519:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "**Step 2.** Format the keys into base32:"
msgstr "**Steg 2.** Formatera nycklarna till base32:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "**Step 3.** Copy the public key:"
msgstr "**Steg 3.** Kopiera den offentliga nyckeln:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "**Step 4.** Create an authorized client file:"
msgstr "**Steg 4.** Skapa en auktoriserad klientfil:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "**Step 5.** Restart the tor service:"
msgstr "**Steg 5.** Starta om tor-tjänsten:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"<56-char-onion-addr-without-.onion-part>:descriptor:x25519:<x25519 private "
"key in base32>"
msgstr ""
"<56-char-onion-addr-without-.onion-part>:descriptor:x25519:<x25519 privat "
"nyckel i base32>"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"Client authorization is a method to make an Onion Service private and "
"authenticated."
msgstr ""
"Klientauktorisering är en metod för att göra en Onion-tjänst privat och "
"autentiserad."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"Client authorization will only be enabled for the service if tor "
"successfully loads at least one authorization file."
msgstr ""
"Klientauktorisering aktiveras endast för tjänsten om tor har läst in minst "
"en auktoriseringsfil."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "Client side"
msgstr "Klientsidan"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "Configuring v3 Onion Services"
msgstr "Konfiguration v3 Onion-tjänster"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"Each file in that directory should be suffixed with \".auth\" (i.e. "
"\"alice.auth\"; the file name is irrelevant) and its content format must be:"
msgstr ""
"Varje fil i den katalogen ska ha suffixet \".auth\" (dvs. \"alice.auth\"; "
"filnamnet är irrelevant) och dess innehållsformat måste vara:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "For example, add this line to `/etc/tor/torrc`:"
msgstr "Lägg till exempel till den här raden i `/etc/tor/torrc`:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"For example, the file `/var/lib/tor/my_website/authorized_clients/"
"alice.auth` should look like:"
msgstr ""
"Till exempel bör filen `/var/lib/tor/my_website/authorized_clients/"
"alice.auth` se ut så här:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "Till exempel:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"For more information about client authentication, please see [Tor manual]"
"(https://2019.www.torproject.org/docs/tor-onion-"
"service.html.en#ClientAuthorization)."
msgstr ""
"För mer information om klientautentisering, se [Tor-manualen](https://"
"2019.www.torproject.org/docs/tor-onion-service.html.en#ClientAuthorization)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"For now, you need to create the keys yourself with a script (like these "
"written in [Bash](https://gist.github.com/mtigas/"
"9c2386adf65345be34045dace134140b), [Rust](https://github.com/haxxpop/"
"torkeygen) or [Python](https://github.com/pastly/python-snippits/blob/master/"
"src/tor/x25519-gen.py)) or manually."
msgstr ""
"För tillfället behöver du skapa nycklarna själv med ett skript (som dessa "
"skrivna i [Bash](https://gist.github.com/mtigas/"
"9c2386adf65345be34045dace134140b), [Rust](https://github.com/haxxpop/"
"torkeygen) eller [Python](https://github.com/pastly/python-snippits/blob/"
"master/src/tor/x25519-gen.py)) eller manuellt."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"For v3 Onion Services, this method works with a pair of keys (a public and a "
"private)."
msgstr ""
"För v3 Onion-tjänster fungerar den här metoden med ett par nycklar (en "
"offentlig och en privat)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"Format the client authentication and create a new file in "
"`<HiddenServiceDir>/authorized_clients/` directory."
msgstr ""
"Formatera klientautentiseringen och skapa en ny fil i katalogen "
"`<HiddenServiceDir>/authorized_clients/`."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"If no authorization is configured, the service will be accessible to anyone "
"with the onion address."
msgstr ""
"Om ingen auktorisering är konfigurerad kommer tjänsten att vara tillgänglig "
"för alla med Onion-adressen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"If you are generating a private key for an onion site, the user does not "
"necessarily need to edit Tor Browser's torrc. It is possible to enter the "
"private key directly in the [Tor Browser](https://tb-manual.torproject.org/"
"onion-services/) interface."
msgstr ""
"Om du genererar en privat nyckel för en Onion-webbplats behöver användaren "
"inte nödvändigtvis redigera Tor Browsers torrc. Det är möjligt att ange den "
"privata nyckeln direkt i [Tor Browser](https://tb-manual.torproject.org/"
"onion-services/)-gränssnittet."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"If you are planning to have more authenticated clients, each file must "
"contain one line only. Any malformed file will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Om du planerar att ha fler autentiserade klienter får varje fil endast "
"innehålla en rad. Felaktigt formaterade filer ignoreras."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/onion-services/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/setup/
msgid ""
"If you get an error message, something has gone wrong and you cannot "
"continue until you've figured out why this didn't work."
msgstr ""
"Om du får ett felmeddelande har något gått fel och du kan inte fortsätta "
"förrän du har listat ut varför det inte fungerade."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"If you manually generated the key pair following the instructions in this "
"page, you can copy and use the private key created in **Step 2**."
msgstr ""
"Om du genererade nyckelparet manuellt enligt instruktionerna på den här "
"sidan kan du kopiera och använda den privata nyckeln som skapades i **steg "
"2**."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"It requires Tor clients to provide an authentication credential in order to "
"connect to the Onion Service."
msgstr ""
"Det kräver att Tor-klienter anger en autentiseringsuppgift för att ansluta "
"till Onion-tjänsten."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "Service side"
msgstr "Servicesidan"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"The `<base32-encoded-public-key>` is the base32 representation of the raw "
"key bytes only (32 bytes for x25519)."
msgstr ""
"`<base32-encoded-public-key>` är base32-representationen av endast den råa "
"nyckelns byte (32 byte för x25519)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"The content of the `<ClientOnionAuthDir>/<user>.auth_private` file should "
"look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Innehållet i filen `<ClientOnionAuthDir>/<user>.auth_private` ska se ut så "
"här:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"The service side is configured with a public key and the client can only "
"access it with a private key."
msgstr ""
"Tjänstsidan är konfigurerad med en publik nyckel och klienten kan bara komma "
"åt den med en privat nyckel."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "The supported values for `<auth-type>` are: \"descriptor\"."
msgstr "De värden som stöds för `<auth-type>` är: \"descriptor\"."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "The supported values for `<key-type>` are: \"x25519\"."
msgstr "De värden som stöds för `<key-type>` är: \"x25519\"."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"Then restart `tor` and you should be able to connect to the Onion Service "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Starta sedan om `tor` så borde du kunna ansluta till Onion-tjänstens adress."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"Then, in the `<ClientOnionAuthDir>` directory, create an `.auth_private` "
"file for the Onion Service corresponding to this key (i.e. "
"'bob_onion.auth_private')."
msgstr ""
"Sedan, i katalogen `<ClientOnionAuthDir>`, skapa en `.auth_private`-fil för "
"Onion-tjänsten som motsvarar denna nyckel (dvs. 'bob_onion.auth_private')."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"To access a version 3 Onion Service with client authorization as a client, "
"make sure you have `ClientOnionAuthDir` set in your torrc."
msgstr ""
"För att komma åt en version 3 Onion-tjänst med klientauktorisering som "
"klient, se till att du har `ClientOnionAuthDir` angivet i din torrc."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"To configure client authorization on the service side, the "
"`<HiddenServiceDir>/authorized_clients/` directory needs to exist. Following "
"the instructions described in the section [Setup](../../setup/) will "
"automatically create this directory."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera klientauktorisering på tjänstsidan måste katalogen "
"`<HiddenServiceDir>/authorized_clients/` finnas. Genom att följa "
"instruktionerna som beskrivs i avsnittet [Setup](../../setup/) skapas den "
"här katalogen automatiskt."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid ""
"To manually generate the keys, you need to install `openssl` version 1.1+ "
"and `basez`."
msgstr ""
"För att generera nycklarna manuellt måste du installera `openssl` version "
"1.1+ och `basez`."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "Learn how to set up client authorization for your Onion Services."
msgstr "Lär dig konfigurera klientauktorisering för dina onion-tjänster."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/client-auth/
msgid "Client Authorization"
msgstr "Kundtillstånd"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/
msgid ""
"In this section you will find how to configure your Onion Service to enable "
"client authorization, Onion-Location and tips to make your Onion Service "
"more secure."
msgstr ""
"I det här avsnittet hittar du hur du konfigurerar din Onion-tjänst för att "
"aktivera klientauktorisering, Onion-platsering och tips för att göra din "
"Onion-tjänst säkrare."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/
msgid ""
"Learn more about how to configure client authentication, Onion-Location and "
"more tips to secure your Onion Service."
msgstr ""
"Läs mer om hur du konfigurerar klientautentisering, Onion-plats och fler "
"tips för att säkra din Onion-tjänst."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Avancerade inställningar"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"A [Proof of Work (PoW)](https://spec.torproject.org/hspow-spec/index.html) "
"defense mechanism is explained in length at the [PoW FAQ](https://"
"onionservices.torproject.org/technology/security/pow/), and can be "
"configured for each Onion Service with the following `torrc` options:"
msgstr ""
"En försvarsmekanism för [Proof of Work (PoW)](https://spec.torproject.org/"
"hspow-spec/index.html) förklaras utförligt i [PoW FAQ](https://"
"onionservices.torproject.org/technology/security/pow/), och kan konfigureras "
"för varje Onion-tjänst med följande `torrc`-alternativ:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Add the secure cookie for the correct verified client, redirect the client "
"to the page which he wants to view."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till den säkra kakan för rätt verifierad klient, omdirigera klienten "
"till den sida hen vill visa."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "All these approaches can be combined."
msgstr "Alla dessa tillvägagångssätt kan kombineras."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "An alternative might be to just implement a test-cookie challenge."
msgstr "Ett alternativ kan vara att bara implementera en test-kaka-utmaning."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"An overview of implemented defenses at the tor daemon is given in the "
"[Overview](https://spec.torproject.org/dos-spec/overview.html) section from "
"the [Denial-of-service prevention mechanisms in Tor](https://"
"spec.torproject.org/dos-spec/index.html) specification, and here we give "
"some practical tips."
msgstr ""
"En översikt över implementerade försvar i Tor-demonen ges i avsnittet "
"[Översikt](https://spec.torproject.org/dos-spec/overview.html) från "
"specifikationen [Mekanismerna för att förhindra överbelastning i Tor]"
"(https://spec.torproject.org/dos-spec/index.html), och här ger vi några "
"praktiska tips."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Another way to reduce the load on your service is to implement content "
"caching, either directly at the backend application or by setting up a "
"caching proxy frontend."
msgstr ""
"Ett annat sätt att minska belastningen på tjänsten är att använda "
"innehållscache, antingen direkt i serverappen eller genom att konfigurera en "
"cacheproxy framför den."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"At the same time [we are working on more advanced defenses](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/stop-the-onion-denial), so that less manual "
"configuration and tinkering is needed by onion operators."
msgstr ""
"Samtidigt [arbetar vi på mer avancerade försvar](https://blog.torproject.org/"
"stop-the-onion-denial), så att mindre manuell konfiguration och justeringar "
"behövs av onion-operatörer."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"At your webserver check that clients can set valid cookies, malicious "
"clients often do not have this feature."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera på din webbserver att klienter kan ställa in giltiga kakor, "
"skadliga klienter har ofta inte den här funktionen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Basic PoW support can be checked by running this command:"
msgstr ""
"Grundläggande PoW-stöd kan kontrolleras genom att köra det här kommandot:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Caching"
msgstr "Cachning"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Captchas and cookies"
msgstr "Captcha och kakor"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Captchas are a way to mitigate DDoS attacks."
msgstr "Captchas är ett sätt att minska antalet DDoS-attacker."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Client authorization or multiple onion addresses to compartmentalize your "
"users"
msgstr ""
"Klientauktorisering eller flera onion-adresser för att dela upp dina "
"användare"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Defending a site under attack requires creativity and a custom-tailored "
"approach."
msgstr ""
"Att försvara en plats under attack kräver kreativitet och en skräddarsydd "
"metod."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Due to license requirements, the PoW v1 client puzzle libraries ([Equi-X]"
"(https://github.com/tevador/equix) and [HashX](https://github.com/tevador/"
"hashx) by tevador, both under the LGPL-3.0) are enabled only if tor is "
"compiled with `--enable-gpl`."
msgstr ""
"På grund av licenskrav är PoW v1-klientpusselbiblioteken ([Equi-X](https://"
"github.com/tevador/equix) och [HashX](https://github.com/tevador/hashx) av "
"tevador, båda under LGPL-3.0) endast aktiverade om tor kompileras med `--"
"enable-gpl`."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"For more information on how they work, check the `tor(1)` manpage and the "
"[Denial-of-Service defense extension (DOS_PARAMS)](https://"
"spec.torproject.org/rend-spec/introduction-protocol.html#EST_INTRO_DOS_EXT) "
"section of the [Onion Services v3 specification](https://spec.torproject.org/"
"rend-spec/index.html)."
msgstr ""
"För mer information om hur de fungerar, se manualsidan `tor(1)` och "
"avsnittet [Denial-of-Service defense extension (DOS_PARAMS)](https://"
"spec.torproject.org/rend-spec/introduction-protocol.html#EST_INTRO_DOS_EXT) "
"i [Onion-tjänster v3-specifikationen](https://spec.torproject.org/rend-spec/"
"index.html)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "For users you don't trust, split them into multiple addresses."
msgstr "För användare du inte litar på, dela upp dem i flera adresser."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"However there is no single one-size-fits-all solution for this problem at "
"the moment."
msgstr ""
"Det finns dock ingen enda lösning som passar alla för detta problem i "
"nuläget."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"If attackers are overwhelming you with aggressive circuits that perform too "
"many queries, try to detect that overuse and kill them using the "
"`HiddenServiceExportCircuitID` torrc option."
msgstr ""
"Om angripare överbelastar dig med aggressiva kretsar som utför för många "
"frågor, försök att upptäcka överanvändningen och avsluta dem med hjälp av "
"torrc-alternativet `HiddenServiceExportCircuitID`."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"If this option is 0, it is considered infinite and thus if "
"HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense is set, it then effectively disables the "
"defenses."
msgstr ""
"Om det här alternativet är 0 anses det vara oändligt och om "
"HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense är inställt inaktiveras försvaret "
"effektivt om det är inställt."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"If you have `pow: yes`, then you have the PoW defense mechanism built into C "
"Tor."
msgstr ""
"Om du har `pow: yes`, så har du PoW-försvarsmekanismen inbyggd i C Tor."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"If you have users you trust, give them dedicated Onion Service and client "
"authorization credentials so that it can always be available."
msgstr ""
"Om du har användare du litar på, ge dem dedikerade Onion-tjänster och "
"klientauktoriseringsuppgifter så att de alltid är tillgängliga."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"If you need to further rate-limit users, split your infrastructure into "
"layers and put Captchas near the frontend."
msgstr ""
"Om du behöver ytterligare begränsa användarfrekvensen, dela upp din "
"infrastruktur i lager och placera Captchas nära frontend."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"If your installed C Tor does not have PoW enabled or is not built with GNU "
"GPL support, then you'll have to look for other packages or compile it "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Om din installerade C Tor inte har PoW aktiverat eller inte är byggd med GNU "
"GPL-stöd, måste du leta efter andra paket eller kompilera det själv."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"In Nginx, Cloudflare provide a [library](https://github.com/cloudflare/lua-"
"resty-cookie) to interact with cookies."
msgstr ""
"I Nginx tillhandahåller Cloudflare ett [bibliotek](https://github.com/"
"cloudflare/lua-resty-cookie) för att interagera med kakor."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "In this page we present a few ways to mitigate DoS attacks currently."
msgstr ""
"På den här sidan presenterar vi några sätt att minska DoS-attacker idag."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Incoming rendezvous requests will be prioritized based on the amount of "
"effort a client chooses to make when computing a solution to the puzzle."
msgstr ""
"Inkommande rendezvousförfrågningar kommer att prioriteras baserat på hur "
"mycket ansträngning en klient väljer att lägga ner när de beräknar en "
"lösning på pusslet."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"It is possible to implement Captchas directly at your webserver with Nginx "
"and OpenResty using [Lua to generate and verify the captcha images](https://"
"github.com/openresty/lua-nginx-module)."
msgstr ""
"Det är möjligt att implementera Captchas direkt på din webbserver med Nginx "
"och OpenResty med hjälp av [Lua för att generera och verifiera captcha-"
"bilderna](https://github.com/openresty/lua-nginx-module)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Nginx sends this input letters to recaptcha server for verification."
msgstr ""
"Nginx skickar dessa inmatningsbokstäver till recaptcha-servern för "
"verifiering."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Onionbalance"
msgstr "Onionbalance"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Onionbalance is available for [v3 Onion Services](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/cooking-onions-reclaiming-onionbalance)."
msgstr ""
"Onionbalance är tillgängligt för [v3 Onion-tjänster](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/cooking-onions-reclaiming-onionbalance)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Other methods include making sure that clients connecting to your .onion "
"have valid User-Agent header and the Referer header is not set to a value "
"you can associate with the attack."
msgstr ""
"Andra metoder är att kontrollera att klienter som ansluter till din .onion-"
"adress har ett giltigt User-Agent-huvud och att Referer-huvudet inte har ett "
"värde som du kan koppla till angreppet."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"PoW is enabled by default on C Tor versions 0.4.8.1-alpha onwards (but can "
"be disabled if compiled with `--disable-module-pow`)."
msgstr ""
"PoW är aktiverat som standard på C Tor-versioner 0.4.8.1-alpha och framåt "
"(men kan inaktiveras om det kompileras med `--disable-module-pow`)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Proof of Work (PoW) before establishing Rendezvous Circuits"
msgstr "Proof of Work (PoW) innan du etablerar rendezvouskretser"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Rate limiting at the Introduction Points"
msgstr "Hastighetsbegränsning vid introduktionspunkterna"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Since [Proposal 305](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/torspec/-/blob/"
"main/proposals/305-establish-intro-dos-defense-extention.txt) was "
"implemented, some `torrc` options were added to help mitigating DoS attacks "
"at the introduction points:"
msgstr ""
"Sedan [Förslag 305](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/torspec/-/blob/"
"main/proposals/305-establish-intro-dos-defense-extention.txt) "
"implementerades har vissa `torrc`-alternativ lagts till för att hjälpa till "
"att mildra DoS-attacker vid introduktionspunkterna:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Stream limits in the established Rendezvous Circuits"
msgstr "Strömningsgränser i de etablerade rendezvouskretser"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"That said, having too many onion addresses is actually bad for your security "
"(because of the use of many guard nodes), so try to use [client "
"authorization](../client-auth/) when possible."
msgstr ""
"Med det sagt är det faktiskt dåligt för din säkerhet att ha för många onion-"
"adresser (på grund av användningen av många vaktnoder), så försök att "
"använda [client authorization](../client-auth/) när det är möjligt."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "The above tips should help you keep afloat in turbulent times."
msgstr ""
"Ovanstående tips bör hjälpa dig att hålla dig flytande i turbulenta tider."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "The client inputs the captcha letters."
msgstr "Klienten matar in captcha-bokstäverna."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"The correct answer from recaptcha server with beginning of \"true...\", else "
"it's beginning with \"false...\"."
msgstr ""
"Rätt svar från recaptcha-servern börjar med \"true...\", annars börjar det "
"med \"false...\"."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"The following configuration options can be used to limit connections in the "
"rendezvous circuits:"
msgstr ""
"Följande konfigurationsalternativ kan användas för att begränsa anslutningar "
"i möteskretsarna:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"The following global option is applicable to both onion services and their "
"clients:"
msgstr ""
"Följande globala alternativ gäller både onion-tjänster och deras klienter:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"The maximum value allowed is 65535. (Setting this to 0 will allow an "
"unlimited number of simultaneous streams.)"
msgstr ""
"Det högsta tillåtna värdet är 65535. (Om värdet anges till 0 tillåts ett "
"obegränsat antal samtidiga strömmar.)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "The more you scale, the harder it is for attackers to overwhelm you."
msgstr ""
"Ju mer du skalar upp, desto svårare blir det för angripare att överbelasta "
"tjänsten."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"The service will periodically update a suggested amount of effort, based on "
"attack load, and disable the puzzle entirely when the service is not "
"overloaded."
msgstr ""
"Tjänsten uppdaterar regelbundet en föreslagen arbetsinsats utifrån "
"angreppsbelastningen och inaktiverar pusslet helt när tjänsten inte är "
"överbelastad."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"This build of Tor is covered by the GNU General Public License (https://"
"www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.en.html)"
msgstr ""
"Den här versionen av Tor omfattas av GNU General Public License (https://"
"www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.en.html)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "This can be confirmed by running the following command:"
msgstr "Du kan bekräfta detta genom att köra följande kommando:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "This implementation isn't easy to configure."
msgstr "Den här implementationen är inte enkel att konfigurera."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"This way attackers will have to solve Captchas before they are able to "
"attack deeper into your infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"På så sätt måste angriparna lösa CAPTCHA-test innan de kan angripa djupare "
"delar av infrastrukturen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Tor compiled with GCC version 12.2.0"
msgstr "Tor kompilerades med GCC version 12.2.0"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"Tor is running on Linux with Libevent 2.1.12-stable, OpenSSL 3.0.9, Zlib "
"1.2.13, Liblzma 5.4.1, Libzstd N/A and Glibc 2.36 as libc."
msgstr ""
"Tor körs på Linux med Libevent 2.1.12-stable, OpenSSL 3.0.9, Zlib 1.2.13, "
"Liblzma 5.4.1, Libzstd N/A och Glibc 2.36 som libc."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Tor version 0.4.8.3-rc."
msgstr "Tor version 0.4.8.3-rc."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Webserver rate limiting"
msgstr "Begränsning av webbserverhastighet"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"When a request comes from a client checks if the client contains the correct "
"secure cookie otherwise redirects to the recaptcha page."
msgstr ""
"När en begäran kommer från en klient kontrolleras om klienten innehåller "
"rätt säker kaka. Annars omdirigeras klienten till reCAPTCHA-sidan."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"When enabled, tor will include parameters for an optional client puzzle in "
"the encrypted portion of this hidden service's descriptor."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet är aktiverat inkluderar tor parametrar för ett valfritt "
"klientpussel i den krypterade delen av den dolda tjänstens deskriptor."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"When this is enabled, the rate and burst parameter will be sent to the intro "
"point which will then use them to apply rate limiting for introduction "
"request to this service."
msgstr ""
"När detta är aktiverat skickas hastighets- och skurparametrarna till "
"introduktionspunkten, som använder dem för att begränsa frekvensen av "
"introduktionsbegäranden till tjänsten."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "You can use Onionbalance to scale horizontally."
msgstr "Du kan använda Onionbalance för horisontell skalning."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"You can use your own heuristics or use your web server's [rate limiting "
"module](https://www.nginx.com/blog/rate-limiting-nginx/)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda egna heuristiker eller webbserverns [modul för "
"hastighetsbegränsning](https://www.nginx.com/blog/rate-limiting-nginx/)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"[Onionbalance](https://onionbalance-v3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/v3/tutorial-"
"v3.html) allows Onion Service operators to achieve the property of high "
"availability by allowing multiple machines to handle requests for an Onion "
"Service."
msgstr ""
"[Onionbalance](https://onionbalance-v3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/v3/tutorial-"
"v3.html) gör det möjligt för operatörer av onion-tjänster att uppnå hög "
"tillgänglighet genom att låta flera datorer hantera begäranden till en onion-"
"tjänst."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`CompiledProofOfWorkHash`: When proof-of-work DoS mitigation is active, both "
"the services themselves and the clients which connect will use a dynamically "
"generated hash function as part of the puzzle computation."
msgstr ""
"`CompiledProofOfWorkHash`: När DoS-skyddet med arbetsbevis är aktivt "
"använder både tjänsterna och klienterna som ansluter en dynamiskt genererad "
"hashfunktion som en del av pusselberäkningen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSBurstPerSec`: The allowed client introduction "
"burst per second at the introduction point."
msgstr ""
"`HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSBurstPerSec`: Tillåten skur av "
"klientintroduktioner per sekund vid introduktionspunkten."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense`: Enable DoS defense at the intropoint "
"level."
msgstr ""
"`HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense`: Aktivera DoS-skydd på "
"introduktionspunktsnivå."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSRatePerSec`: The allowed client introduction "
"rate per second at the introduction point."
msgstr ""
"`HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSRatePerSec`: Tillåten frekvens för "
"klientintroduktioner per sekund vid introduktionspunkten."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`HiddenServiceMaxStreamsCloseCircuit`: If set to 1, then exceeding "
"HiddenServiceMaxStreams will cause the offending rendezvous circuit to be "
"torn down, as opposed to stream creation requests that exceed the limit "
"being silently ignored."
msgstr ""
"`HiddenServiceMaxStreamsCloseCircuit`: Om värdet är 1 rivs den felande "
"möteskretsen ned när HiddenServiceMaxStreams överskrids, i stället för att "
"begäranden om att skapa strömmar över gränsen ignoreras utan meddelande."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`HiddenServiceMaxStreams`: The maximum number of simultaneous streams "
"(connections) per rendezvous circuit."
msgstr ""
"`HiddenServiceMaxStreams`: Högsta antal samtidiga strömmar (anslutningar) "
"per möteskrets."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled`: Enable proof-of-work based service DoS "
"mitigation."
msgstr ""
"`HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled`: Aktivera DoS-skydd för tjänsten baserat "
"på arbetsbevis."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`HiddenServicePoWQueueBurst`: The maximum burst size for rendezvous requests "
"handled from the priority queue at once."
msgstr ""
"`HiddenServicePoWQueueBurst`: Största skurstorlek för mötesbegäranden som "
"hanteras samtidigt från prioritetskön."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid ""
"`HiddenServicePoWQueueRate`: The sustained rate of rendezvous requests to "
"dispatch per second from the priority queue."
msgstr ""
"`HiddenServicePoWQueueRate`: Kontinuerlig frekvens för mötesbegäranden som "
"ska skickas per sekund från prioritetskön."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.section
#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.section
#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.section
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "Avancerad konfiguration"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Tips to help you keep afloat in turbulent times."
msgstr "Tips som hjälper dig att hålla dig flytande i turbulenta tider."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/dos/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/dos/
msgid "Onion service DoS guidelines"
msgstr "Riktlinjer för DoS-skydd av onion-tjänster"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"1. As anyone can generate an onion address and its 56 random alphanumeric "
"characters, some enterprise administrators believe that associating their "
"onion site to an HTTPS certificate might be a solution to announce their "
"service to users."
msgstr ""
"1. Eftersom vem som helst kan skapa en onion-adress med 56 slumpmässiga "
"alfanumeriska tecken anser vissa företagsadministratörer att ett HTTPS-"
"certifikat för onion-webbplatsen kan vara ett sätt att bekräfta tjänstens "
"identitet för användarna."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"2. Another topic of this discussion is user expectations and modern browsers."
msgstr ""
"2. Ett annat ämne i diskussionen är användarnas förväntningar och moderna "
"webbläsare."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"3. One of the risks of using a certificate issued by a CA is that `.onion` "
"names might unintentionally get [leaked](https://crt.sh/?q=.onion) if the "
"Onion Service owners use HTTPS due to [Certificate Transparency](https://"
"certificate.transparency.dev/)."
msgstr ""
"3. En risk med ett certifikat utfärdat av en certifikatutfärdare är att "
"`.onion`-namn oavsiktligt kan [läcka](https://crt.sh/?q=.onion) om onion-"
"tjänstens ägare använder HTTPS, på grund av [Certificate Transparency]"
"(https://certificate.transparency.dev/)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"4. Some websites have a complex setup, and are serving HTTP and HTTPS "
"content."
msgstr ""
"4. Vissa webbplatser har en komplicerad konfiguration och levererar innehåll "
"både via HTTP och HTTPS."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"5. Related to the previous point, some protocols, frameworks, and "
"infrastructures use SSL as a technical requirement; they won't work if they "
"don't see an \"https://\" link."
msgstr ""
"5. I anslutning till föregående punkt kräver vissa protokoll, ramverk och "
"infrastrukturer SSL av tekniska skäl. De fungerar inte om de inte ser en "
"länk som börjar med ”https://”."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid "6. Actually HTTPS does give you a little bit more than Onion Services."
msgstr "6. HTTPS ger faktiskt något mer än onion-tjänster."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"Alternatively, websites can provide other ways to verify their onion address "
"using HTTPS, for example, linking their onion site address from an HTTPS-"
"authenticated page, or using [Onion-Location](../onion-location/)."
msgstr ""
"Alternativt kan webbplatser erbjuda andra sätt att verifiera onion-adressen "
"med HTTPS, till exempel genom att länka till onion-webbplatsens adress från "
"en HTTPS-autentiserad sida eller använda [Onion-Location](../onion-"
"location/)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"Another option is to use webserver rules to rewrite absolute links on the "
"fly."
msgstr ""
"Ett annat alternativ är att använda webbserverregler för att skriva om "
"absoluta länkar dynamiskt."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"As \".onion\" is a [special top level domain name](https://tools.ietf.org/"
"html/rfc7686), most Certificate Authorities don't have support for issuing "
"X.509 certificates for onion sites."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom ”.onion” är ett [särskilt toppdomännamn](https://tools.ietf.org/"
"html/rfc7686) stöder de flesta certifikatutfärdare inte utfärdande av X.509-"
"certifikat för onion-webbplatser."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"For a detailed step by step how to create an HTTPS onion certificate, check "
"[Brave's blog post](https://brave.com/new-onion-service/)."
msgstr ""
"En detaljerad steg-för-steg-guide för att skapa ett HTTPS-certifikat för en "
"onion-webbplats finns i [Braves blogginlägg](https://brave.com/new-onion-"
"service/)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"For example, in the case where the webserver isn't in the same location as "
"the Tor program, you would need to use an HTTPS certificate to avoid "
"exposing unencrypted traffic to the network in between the two."
msgstr ""
"Om webbservern exempelvis inte finns på samma plats som Tor-programmet "
"behöver du använda ett HTTPS-certifikat för att undvika att okrypterad "
"trafik exponeras i nätverket mellan dem."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"If this proposal gets implemented, an Onion Service operator could make "
"their own HTTPS certificate chain using an onion key to sign it."
msgstr ""
"Om förslaget genomförs kan en operatör av en onion-tjänst skapa en egen "
"HTTPS-certifikatkedja som signeras med en onion-nyckel."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"In that case, just using Onion Services over HTTP could leak [secure cookies]"
"(https://onionservices.torproject.org/apps/web/onionspray/security/"
"advisories/001-torbrowser/)."
msgstr ""
"I det fallet kan användning av onion-tjänster enbart via HTTP läcka [säkra "
"kakor](https://onionservices.torproject.org/apps/web/onionspray/security/"
"advisories/001-torbrowser/)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"In that case, your Onion Service will need to use an HTTPS certificate in "
"order to function."
msgstr ""
"I det fallet måste onion-tjänsten använda ett HTTPS-certifikat för att "
"fungera."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"In the nearby future, we hope that [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) "
"CA can start issuing v3 onion certificates for free."
msgstr ""
"Vi hoppas att certifikatutfärdaren [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) "
"inom en snar framtid kan börja utfärda kostnadsfria v3-onion-certifikat."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"Modern browsers indicate that a connection is insecure if not using TLS, and "
"require that a TLS connection is authenticated by a CA-issued x.509 "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Moderna webbläsare anger att en anslutning är osäker om den inte använder "
"TLS och kräver att en TLS-anslutning autentiseras med ett X.509-certifikat "
"som utfärdats av en certifikatutfärdare."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"No certificate authority is required for this proof, because the name of the "
"service is the actual public key used to authenticate the underlying "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Ingen certifikatutfärdare behövs för detta bevis, eftersom tjänstens namn är "
"den faktiska offentliga nyckel som används för att autentisera den "
"underliggande anslutningen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"Or use a reverse proxy in the middle (more specifically [Onionspray][] with "
"an HTTPS certificate)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda en omvänd proxy mellan dem (närmare bestämt [Onionspray]"
"[] med ett HTTPS-certifikat)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Läs mer"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"Recently in 2020, the Certificate Authority/Browser Forum voted and "
"[approved version 3 onion certificates](https://archive.cabforum.org/"
"pipermail/servercert-wg/2020-February/001637.html), so CAs are now allowed "
"to issue Domain Validation (DV) and Organization Validation (OV) "
"certificates containing Tor onion addresses."
msgstr ""
"År 2020 röstade Certificate Authority/Browser Forum om och [godkände version "
"3-onion-certifikat](https://archive.cabforum.org/pipermail/servercert-wg/"
"2020-February/001637.html). Certifikatutfärdare får därför numera utfärda "
"certifikat med domänvalidering (DV) och organisationsvalidering (OV) som "
"innehåller Tor-onion-adresser."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"Remember that there's no requirement for the webserver and the Tor process "
"to be on the same machine."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att webbservern och Tor-processen inte måste finnas på samma dator."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid "Right now, HTTPS certificates are only provided by:"
msgstr "För närvarande tillhandahålls HTTPS-certifikat endast av:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"That said, there are some specific cases where you would need or want to "
"have an HTTPS for your onion site."
msgstr ""
"Det finns dock vissa särskilda fall där du behöver eller vill använda HTTPS "
"för onion-webbplatsen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"There are some alternatives you might want to try to address this problem:"
msgstr "Det finns några alternativ som du kan prova för att lösa problemet:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"There is an [open proposal](https://github.com/alecmuffett/onion-dv-"
"certificate-proposal/blob/master/text/draft-muffett-same-origin-onion-"
"certificates.txt) to allow Tor Browser to verify self-created HTTPS "
"certificates."
msgstr ""
"Det finns ett [öppet förslag](https://github.com/alecmuffett/onion-dv-"
"certificate-proposal/blob/master/text/draft-muffett-same-origin-onion-"
"certificates.txt) om att låta Tor Browser verifiera självskapade HTTPS-"
"certifikat."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"This way the content will work smoothly, independently of what website name "
"it's being served from."
msgstr ""
"På så sätt fungerar innehållet smidigt oavsett vilket webbplatsnamn det "
"levereras från."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"This will mean that you don't need to involve a third-party in making it, so "
"no third-party will know that your onion exists."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att du inte behöver involvera en tredje part när certifikatet "
"skapas, så ingen tredje part får veta att onion-tjänsten finns."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"To avoid using an HTTPS certificate for your onion, the easiest answer is to "
"write all your content so it uses only relative links."
msgstr ""
"Det enklaste sättet att undvika ett HTTPS-certifikat för onion-webbplatsen "
"är att skriva allt innehåll så att det endast använder relativa länkar."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid "Tor Browser would know how to verify such a self-created chain."
msgstr "Tor Browser skulle kunna verifiera en sådan självskapad kedja."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"Tor Developers and UX team worked together to bring a new user experience "
"for Tor Browser users, so when a user visits an onion site using HTTP, [Tor "
"Browser doesn't display a warning or error message](https://"
"support.torproject.org/onionservices/onionservices-5/)."
msgstr ""
"Tor-utvecklarna och UX-teamet arbetade tillsammans för att förbättra "
"upplevelsen för Tor Browser-användare. När en användare besöker en onion-"
"webbplats via HTTP [visar Tor Browser därför ingen varning eller något "
"felmeddelande](https://support.torproject.org/onionservices/"
"onionservices-5/)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"Users would need to click and do a manual verification, and that would show "
"that they're visiting the onion site that they're expecting."
msgstr ""
"Användarna behöver klicka och göra en manuell verifiering, som visar att de "
"besöker den onion-webbplats de förväntar sig."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"We compiled some topics and arguments, so you can analyze what's the best "
"for your onion site:"
msgstr ""
"Vi har sammanställt några ämnen och argument så att du kan bedöma vad som "
"passar bäst för din onion-webbplats:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"We wrote about [Tor Browser security expectations](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/tor-brower-onion-services-challenges-opportunities), and "
"how we're working on Onion Services usability and adoption."
msgstr ""
"Vi har skrivit om [säkerhetsförväntningar på Tor Browser](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/tor-brower-onion-services-challenges-opportunities) och "
"hur vi arbetar med onion-tjänsters användbarhet och spridning."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid "What's next"
msgstr "Vad händer härnäst?"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"When visiting a site over HTTPS (HTTP over TLS), the TLS protocol prevents "
"data in transit from being read or manipulated by man in the middle attacks, "
"and an x.509 certificate obtained from a Certificate Authority (CA) "
"validates that the user is actually connecting to a server representing the "
"domain name in the browser address bar."
msgstr ""
"När en webbplats besöks via HTTPS (HTTP över TLS) förhindrar TLS-protokollet "
"att data under överföringen läses eller manipuleras genom man-i-mitten-"
"angrepp. Ett X.509-certifikat från en certifikatutfärdare (CA) bekräftar att "
"användaren faktiskt ansluter till en server som representerar domännamnet i "
"webbläsarens adressfält."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"When visiting a site over the Onion Services protocol, the Tor protocol "
"prevents data in transit from being read or manipulated by man in the middle "
"attacks, and the Onion Service protocol validates that the user is connected "
"to the domain name in the browser address bar."
msgstr ""
"När en webbplats besöks via protokollet för onion-tjänster förhindrar Tor-"
"protokollet att data under överföringen läses eller manipuleras genom man-i-"
"mitten-angrepp. Protokollet för onion-tjänster bekräftar dessutom att "
"användaren är ansluten till domännamnet i webbläsarens adressfält."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"While there is extensive criticism regarding HTTPS and the CA trust model, "
"the information security community has taught users to look for HTTPS when "
"visiting a website as a synonym of secure connection, and to avoid HTTP "
"connections."
msgstr ""
"Även om HTTPS och tillitsmodellen med certifikatutfärdare har kritiserats "
"mycket har informationssäkerhetsgemenskapen lärt användare att se HTTPS som "
"ett tecken på en säker anslutning och att undvika HTTP-anslutningar."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"[DigiCert: Get TLS certificate with Extended Validation (EV) for your onion "
"site (2015)](https://www.digicert.com/blog/onion-officially-recognized-"
"special-use-domain/)"
msgstr ""
"[DigiCert: Skaffa ett TLS-certifikat med utökad validering (EV) för din "
"onion-webbplats (2015)](https://www.digicert.com/blog/onion-officially-"
"recognized-special-use-domain/)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"[DigiCert](https://www.digicert.com/) with an Extended Validation (EV) TLS "
"certificate, which means a considerable cost for an organization."
msgstr ""
"[DigiCert](https://www.digicert.com/) med ett TLS-certifikat med utökad "
"validering (EV), vilket innebär en betydande kostnad för en organisation."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"[Facebook, hidden services, and https certs (2014)](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/facebook-hidden-services-and-https-certs)"
msgstr ""
"[Facebook, dolda tjänster och HTTPS-certifikat (2014)](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/facebook-hidden-services-and-https-certs)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"[HARICA: Get a TLS certificate with Domain Validation (DV) for your onion "
"site (2021)](https://blog.torproject.org/tls-certificate-for-onion-site)"
msgstr ""
"[HARICA: Skaffa ett TLS-certifikat med domänvalidering (DV) för din onion-"
"webbplats (2021)](https://blog.torproject.org/tls-certificate-for-onion-site)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"[HARICA](https://www.harica.gr) with Domain Validation (DV) TLS certificates."
msgstr ""
"[HARICA](https://www.harica.gr) med TLS-certifikat med domänvalidering (DV)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"[The \".onion\" Special-Use Domain Name - IETF RFC 7686](https://"
"tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7686)"
msgstr ""
"[Det särskilda toppdomännamnet ”.onion” – IETF RFC 7686](https://"
"tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7686)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid ""
"[Tor Browser and Onion Services - Challenges and Opportunities (2020)]"
"(https://blog.torproject.org/tor-brower-onion-services-challenges-"
"opportunities)"
msgstr ""
"[Tor Browser och onion-tjänster – utmaningar och möjligheter (2020)](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/tor-brower-onion-services-challenges-opportunities)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid "Learn why some onions have TLS certificates."
msgstr "Läs varför vissa onion-webbplatser har TLS-certifikat."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/https/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/https/
msgid "HTTPS for your Onion Service"
msgstr "HTTPS för din onion-tjänst"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"**Step 1.** Create an Onion service by setting the following in `torrc`:"
msgstr "**Steg 1.** Skapa en onion-tjänst genom att ange följande i `torrc`:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "**Step 1.** Enable headers and rewrite modules and reload Apache2"
msgstr ""
"**Steg 1.** Aktivera modulerna för huvuden och omskrivning och läs in "
"Apache2 på nytt"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"**Step 2.** Add the Onion-Location header to your Virtual Host configuration "
"file"
msgstr ""
"**Steg 2.** Lägg till Onion-Location-huvudet i konfigurationsfilen för den "
"virtuella värden"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "**Step 2.** Edit website configuration file"
msgstr "**Steg 2.** Redigera webbplatsens konfigurationsfil"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "**Step 3.** Reload Apache"
msgstr "**Steg 3.** Läs in Apache på nytt"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "**Step 3.** Test website configuration"
msgstr "**Steg 3.** Testa webbplatskonfigurationen"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "**Step 4.** Restart nginx"
msgstr "**Steg 4.** Starta om nginx"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "**Step 4.** Testing your Onion-Location"
msgstr "**Steg 4.** Testa din Onion-Location"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "**Step 5.** Testing your Onion-Location"
msgstr "**Steg 5.** Testa din Onion-Location"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "**Testing it out:** Test it out with:"
msgstr "**Testa konfigurationen:** Kör följande:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/onion-services/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/setup/
msgid "Apache"
msgstr "Apache"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Caddy"
msgstr "Caddy"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"Caddy features [automatic HTTPS](https://caddyserver.com/docs/automatic-"
"https) by default, so it provisions your TLS certificate and takes care of "
"HTTP-to-HTTPS redirection for you."
msgstr ""
"Caddy har [automatisk HTTPS](https://caddyserver.com/docs/automatic-https) "
"aktiverat som standard, så servern skaffar ditt TLS-certifikat och hanterar "
"omdirigeringen från HTTP till HTTPS."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/onion-services/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/setup/
msgid "Check your web server and operating system documentation."
msgstr "Läs dokumentationen för webbservern och operativsystemet."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"For the header to be valid the following conditions need to be fulfilled:"
msgstr ""
"Följande villkor måste vara uppfyllda för att huvudet ska vara giltigt:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"For this reason, visitors are always redirected to the .onion URL specified "
"in the content-part of the meta tag, regardless of which subpage they are on."
msgstr ""
"Därför omdirigeras besökarna alltid till den .onion-URL som anges i "
"metataggens content-del, oavsett vilken undersida de befinner sig på."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"HTML cannot read the requested URL and insert it dynamically in the http-"
"equiv `<meta>` tag."
msgstr ""
"HTML kan inte läsa den begärda URL:en och infoga den dynamiskt i http-equiv-"
"`<meta>`-taggen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"Header set Onion-Location \"http://your-onion-address.onion%{REQUEST_URI}s\""
msgstr ""
"Header set Onion-Location \"http://your-onion-address.onion%{REQUEST_URI}s\""

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"If you're running a static site and have the onion address in a "
"`$TOR_HOSTNAME` environment variable, your Caddyfile will look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Om du kör en statisk webbplats och har onion-adressen i miljövariabeln "
"`$TOR_HOSTNAME` ser din Caddyfile ut så här:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"If you're using Caddy 2, to include an Onion-Location header, add the "
"following declaration in your Caddyfile:"
msgstr ""
"Om du använder Caddy 2 lägger du till följande deklaration i din Caddyfile "
"för att inkludera ett Onion-Location-huvud:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"In `/etc/nginx/conf.d/<your-website>.conf` add the Onion-Location header and "
"the Onion Service address."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till Onion-Location-huvudet och onion-tjänstens adress i `/etc/nginx/"
"conf.d/<your-website>.conf`."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Begränsningar"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Look for `onion-location` entry and the Onion Service address."
msgstr "Leta efter posten `onion-location` och onion-tjänstens adress."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "More information"
msgstr "Mer information"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/onion-services/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/setup/
msgid ""
"On this page, the commands to manage the web server are based on Debian-like "
"operating systems and may differ from other systems."
msgstr ""
"På den här sidan utgår kommandona för att hantera webbservern från Debian-"
"liknande operativsystem och kan skilja sig på andra system."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Onion-Location is an easy way to advertise an onion site to the users."
msgstr ""
"Onion-Location är ett enkelt sätt att upplysa användare om en onion-"
"webbplats."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"Or open the website in Tor Browser and a purple pill will appear in the "
"address bar."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också öppna webbplatsen i Tor Browser. Då visas en lila knapp i "
"adressfältet."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"Or, open the web site in Tor Browser and a purple pill will appear in the "
"address bar."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också öppna webbplatsen i Tor Browser. Då visas en lila knapp i "
"adressfältet."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"Read the [Onion-Location spec](https://gitweb.torproject.org/tor-browser-"
"spec.git/tree/proposals/100-onion-location-header.txt)."
msgstr ""
"Läs [specifikationen för Onion-Location](https://gitweb.torproject.org/tor-"
"browser-spec.git/tree/proposals/100-onion-location-header.txt)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Reload the apache2 service, so your configuration changes take effect:"
msgstr ""
"Läs in tjänsten apache2 på nytt så att konfigurationsändringarna börjar "
"gälla:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"The Onion-Location header would be equivalent to a `<meta http-equiv=\"onion-"
"location\" content=\"http://<your-onion-service-address>.onion\" />` added "
"in the HTML head element of the webpage. Replace `<your-onion-service-"
"address.onion>` with the Onion Service that you want to redirect."
msgstr ""
"Onion-Location-huvudet motsvarar en `<meta http-equiv=\"onion-location\" "
"content=\"http://<your-onion-service-address>.onion\" />`-tagg i webbsidans "
"HTML-head-element. Ersätt `<your-onion-service-address.onion>` med den onion-"
"tjänst som du vill omdirigera till."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"The Onion-Location value must be a valid URL with http: or https: protocol "
"and a .onion hostname."
msgstr ""
"Värdet för Onion-Location måste vara en giltig URL med protokollet http: "
"eller https: och ett .onion-värdnamn."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "The configuration file with the Onion-Location should look like this:"
msgstr "Konfigurationsfilen med Onion-Location ska se ut så här:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"The identical behaviour of Onion-Location includes the option of defining it "
"as a HTML `<meta>` http-equiv attribute."
msgstr ""
"Samma funktion som Onion-Location kan definieras med HTML-attributet http-"
"equiv i en `<meta>`-tagg."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "The web server should confirm that the new syntax is working:"
msgstr "Webbservern bör bekräfta att den nya syntaxen fungerar:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"The webpage defining the Onion-Location header must be served over HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Webbsidan som definierar Onion-Location-huvudet måste levereras via HTTPS."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"The webpage defining the Onion-Location header must not be an onion site."
msgstr ""
"Webbsidan som definierar Onion-Location-huvudet får inte vara en onion-"
"webbplats."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Therefore, if possible, we recommend using one of the above methods."
msgstr ""
"Vi rekommenderar därför att du använder någon av metoderna ovan om det är "
"möjligt."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"This may be used by websites that prefer (or need) to define an Onion-"
"Location by modifying the served HTML content instead of adding a new HTTP "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Detta kan användas av webbplatser som föredrar eller behöver definiera Onion-"
"Location genom att ändra HTML-innehållet som levereras i stället för att "
"lägga till ett nytt HTTP-huvud."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"To configure an Onion-Location header, the service operator should first "
"configure an Onion service."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera ett Onion-Location-huvud bör tjänsteoperatören först "
"konfigurera en onion-tjänst."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"To configure this header in Apache 2.2 or above, you will need to enable a "
"`headers` and `rewrite` modules and edit the website Virtual Host file."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera huvudet i Apache 2.2 eller senare måste du aktivera "
"modulerna `headers` och `rewrite` och redigera webbplatsens Virtual Host-fil."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"To test if Onion-Location is working, fetch the website HTTP headers, for "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"Testa om Onion-Location fungerar genom att hämta webbplatsens HTTP-huvuden, "
"till exempel:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Using an HTML `<meta>` attribute"
msgstr "Använda ett HTML-`<meta>`-attribut"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Virtual Host example:"
msgstr "Exempel på Virtual Host:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"Where `your-onion-address.onion` is the Onion Service address you want to "
"redirect and `{REQUEST_URI}` is the [path component of the requested URI]"
"(https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_rewrite.html), such as \"/"
"index.html\"."
msgstr ""
"Här är `your-onion-address.onion` adressen till den onion-tjänst som du vill "
"omdirigera till och `{REQUEST_URI}` är [sökvägsdelen i den begärda URI:n]"
"(https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_rewrite.html), till exempel ”/"
"index.html”."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid ""
"You can either configure a web server to show an Onion-Location Header or "
"add an HTML `<meta>` attribute in the website."
msgstr ""
"Du kan antingen konfigurera en webbserver så att den visar ett Onion-"
"Location-huvud eller lägga till ett HTML-`<meta>`-attribut på webbplatsen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Learn how to set up an Onion-Location for your onion site."
msgstr "Lär dig konfigurera Onion-Location för din onion-webbplats."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/onion-location/
msgid "Onion-Location"
msgstr "Onion-Location"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid "Also, here are some more anonymity issues you should keep in mind:"
msgstr "Här är även några andra anonymitetsfrågor som du bör tänka på:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid "Another common issue is whether to use HTTPS on your onionsite or not."
msgstr "En annan vanlig fråga är om HTTPS ska användas på onion-webbplatsen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"As mentioned [here](../../setup/), be careful of letting your web server "
"reveal identifying information about you, your computer, or your location."
msgstr ""
"Som nämns [här](../../setup/) måste du se till att webbservern inte avslöjar "
"identifierande information om dig, din dator eller din plats."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"For example, readers can probably determine whether it's thttpd or Apache, "
"and learn something about your operating system."
msgstr ""
"Läsare kan exempelvis sannolikt avgöra om servern använder thttpd eller "
"Apache och få viss information om operativsystemet."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"For some security suggestions please make sure you read over Riseup's [\"Tor "
"Hidden (Onion) Services Best Practices\" document](https://riseup.net/en/"
"security/network-security/tor/onionservices-best-practices)."
msgstr ""
"Läs gärna Riseups dokument [”Tor Hidden (Onion) Services Best Practices”]"
"(https://riseup.net/en/security/network-security/tor/onionservices-best-"
"practices) för säkerhetsrekommendationer."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"Have a look at [this post](https://blog.torproject.org/blog/facebook-hidden-"
"services-and-https-certs) on the Tor Blog to learn more about these issues."
msgstr ""
"Läs [det här inlägget](https://blog.torproject.org/blog/facebook-hidden-"
"services-and-https-certs) på Tor Blog för mer information om frågorna."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"If your computer isn't online all the time, your Onion Service won't be "
"either."
msgstr ""
"Om datorn inte alltid är ansluten är onion-tjänsten inte heller alltid "
"tillgänglig."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"It is generally a better idea to host Onion Services on a Tor client rather "
"than a Tor relay, since relay uptime and other properties are publicly "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Det är i allmänhet bättre att vara värd för onion-tjänster på en Tor-klient "
"än på ett Tor-relä, eftersom reläets drifttid och andra egenskaper är "
"offentligt synliga."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"Onion services operators need to practice proper [operational security]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/OperationalSecurity) "
"and system administration to maintain security."
msgstr ""
"Operatörer av onion-tjänster måste tillämpa god [operativ säkerhet](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/OperationalSecurity) och "
"systemadministration för att upprätthålla säkerheten."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"The longer an Onion Service is online, the higher the risk that its location "
"is discovered."
msgstr ""
"Ju längre en onion-tjänst är tillgänglig, desto större är risken att dess "
"plats upptäcks."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"The most prominent attacks are building a profile of the Onion Service's "
"availability and matching induced traffic patterns."
msgstr ""
"De mest framträdande angreppen är att skapa en profil över onion-tjänstens "
"tillgänglighet och matcha framkallade trafikmönster."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid "This leaks information to an observant adversary."
msgstr "Detta läcker information till en observant motståndare."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid ""
"To protect your Onion Service from advanced attacks you should use "
"[Vanguards addon](https://github.com/mikeperry-tor/vanguards), read [Tor "
"blog about Vanguards](https://blog.torproject.org/announcing-vanguards-add-"
"onion-services) and [Vanguards' Security README](https://github.com/"
"mikeperry-tor/vanguards/blob/master/README_SECURITY.md)."
msgstr ""
"För att skydda onion-tjänsten mot avancerade angrepp bör du använda "
"[tillägget Vanguards](https://github.com/mikeperry-tor/vanguards), läsa "
"[Tors blogginlägg om Vanguards](https://blog.torproject.org/announcing-"
"vanguards-add-onion-services) och [Vanguards säkerhets-README](https://"
"github.com/mikeperry-tor/vanguards/blob/master/README_SECURITY.md)."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid "Learn more tips to secure your Onion Services."
msgstr "Få fler tips om hur du skyddar dina onion-tjänster."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/opsec/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/opsec/
msgid "Operational Security"
msgstr "Operativ säkerhet"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"\"Vanity\" onion addresses are a partial workaround for the difficulty of "
"memorizing the 56-character-long onion addresses."
msgstr ""
"Anpassade onion-adresser är en partiell lösning på svårigheten att komma "
"ihåg onion-adresser med 56 tecken."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"**Step 1.** Install the [requirements](https://github.com/cathugger/"
"mkp224o#requirements)"
msgstr ""
"**Steg 1.** Installera [beroendena](https://github.com/cathugger/"
"mkp224o#requirements)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"**Step 2.** Follow the [build instructions](https://github.com/cathugger/"
"mkp224o#building)"
msgstr ""
"**Steg 2.** Följ [bygginstruktionerna](https://github.com/cathugger/"
"mkp224o#building)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "**Step 3.** Run the generator"
msgstr "**Steg 3.** Kör generatorn"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"A vanity address is an onion address that starts with a pre-chosen number of "
"characters, usually a meaningful name related to a specific Onion Service."
msgstr ""
"En anpassad adress är en onion-adress som börjar med ett antal förvalda "
"tecken, vanligtvis ett betydelsefullt namn med anknytning till en viss onion-"
"tjänst."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"Additionally, if you are looking for a more advanced tool, see [Onionmine]"
"(https://onionservices.torproject.org/apps/web/onionmine/), a handy wrapper "
"for `mkp224o` that can also handle TLS certificate generation for Onion "
"Services."
msgstr ""
"Om du söker ett mer avancerat verktyg kan du även använda [Onionmine]"
"(https://onionservices.torproject.org/apps/web/onionmine/), ett praktiskt "
"gränssnitt för `mkp224o` som också kan hantera skapandet av TLS-certifikat "
"för onion-tjänster."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"An attacker wishing to impersonate an existing onionsite by creating a fake "
"version of it might use vanity addresses as an additional way to convince "
"users that their address is the right one."
msgstr ""
"En angripare som vill efterlikna en befintlig onion-webbplats genom att "
"skapa en falsk version kan använda anpassade adresser som ytterligare ett "
"sätt att övertyga användarna om att den falska adressen är den rätta."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "But it also has some disadvantages:"
msgstr "Det finns dock också nackdelar:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"For example, when running many [Onionbalance](https://"
"onionbalance.readthedocs.io/en/latest/) backends."
msgstr ""
"Till exempel när många bakändar för [Onionbalance](https://"
"onionbalance.readthedocs.io/en/latest/) körs."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"For instance, one might try to generate an onion address for the "
"`mysitename` website and end up with something looking like this:"
msgstr ""
"Man kan exempelvis försöka skapa en onion-adress för webbplatsen "
"`mysitename` och få något som ser ut så här:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"If the legitimate site does not use a vanity address, users might think that "
"the fake site is the valid one because it has a nicer address."
msgstr ""
"Om den legitima webbplatsen inte använder en anpassad adress kan användarna "
"tro att den falska webbplatsen är den riktiga, eftersom den har en snyggare "
"adress."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"It consumes resources (time and energy): the bigger the vanity name, the "
"longer (and more computing power) it takes."
msgstr ""
"Det förbrukar resurser i form av tid och energi: ju längre det anpassade "
"namnet är, desto längre tid och mer beräkningskraft krävs."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "It has some branding appeal to site owners."
msgstr "Det kan vara attraktivt för webbplatsägarens varumärke."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"It is easy for Onion Services operators to debug their logs and know which "
"services have errors without recurring to a table or to memorize some random "
"characters from a regular onion address."
msgstr ""
"Det blir enklare för operatörer av onion-tjänster att felsöka loggar och se "
"vilka tjänster som har fel utan att behöva använda en tabell eller memorera "
"slumpmässiga tecken från en vanlig onion-adress."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"It is easy for Onion Services users to know which site they are about to "
"access."
msgstr ""
"Det blir enklare för användare av onion-tjänster att se vilken webbplats de "
"är på väg att öppna."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"It is relatively easy for anybody with average computing resources to create "
"other keys beginning with `mysitename` (although they are very unlikely to "
"come up with the exact key from the example above)."
msgstr ""
"Det är relativt enkelt för vem som helst med genomsnittliga datorresurser "
"att skapa andra nycklar som börjar med `mysitename`, även om sannolikheten "
"är mycket liten att de får fram exakt samma nyckel som i exemplet ovan."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"So, in a sense, vanity keys might be confusing and offer a false sense of "
"identity; users can easily be mistaken into accessing an impersonating onion "
"service just because it starts with `mysitename`."
msgstr ""
"Anpassade nycklar kan alltså vara förvirrande och ge en falsk känsla av "
"identitet. Användare kan lätt luras att öppna en onion-tjänst som utger sig "
"för att vara en annan enbart för att adressen börjar med `mysitename`."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"The long-term solution involves a better onion naming scheme, and vanity "
"addresses would remain only as a way to help system administrators group "
"onion addresses."
msgstr ""
"Den långsiktiga lösningen kräver ett bättre namnsystem för onion-tjänster. "
"Anpassade adresser skulle då endast användas för att hjälpa "
"systemadministratörer att gruppera onion-adresser."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "This has some advantages:"
msgstr "Detta har vissa fördelar:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"This will create the `onions` directory and others needed for each of the "
"discovered onion addresses with their respective keys."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot skapar katalogen `onions` och de andra kataloger som behövs för "
"var och en av de hittade onion-adresserna, tillsammans med respektive "
"nycklar."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"To know what else the tool can do, refer to its help by executing the "
"following command:"
msgstr ""
"Kör följande kommando för att öppna hjälpen och se vad verktyget mer kan "
"göra:"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "Vanity address generation"
msgstr "Skapa anpassade adresser"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"[Onion Services UX Proposals](https://onionservices.torproject.org/research/"
"proposals/usability/)"
msgstr ""
"[UX-förslag för onion-tjänster](https://onionservices.torproject.org/"
"research/proposals/usability/)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"[Tips when mining Onion Addresses](https://onionservices.torproject.org/apps/"
"web/onionspray/guides/mining/)"
msgstr ""
"[Tips när du utvinner onion-adresser](https://onionservices.torproject.org/"
"apps/web/onionspray/guides/mining/)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"[mkp224o FAQ](https://github.com/cathugger/mkp224o#faq-and-other-useful-info)"
msgstr ""
"[Vanliga frågor om mkp224o](https://github.com/cathugger/mkp224o#faq-and-"
"other-useful-info)"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid ""
"`mkp224o` is one of the tools that can be used to generate vanity addresses."
msgstr ""
"`mkp224o` är ett av verktygen som kan användas för att skapa anpassade "
"adresser."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "mysitenameyx4fi3l6x2gyzmtmgxjyqyorj9qsb5r543izcwymle.onion"
msgstr "mysitenameyx4fi3l6x2gyzmtmgxjyqyorj9qsb5r543izcwymle.onion"

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "More easily recognizable onion addresses."
msgstr "Onion-adresser som är enklare att känna igen."

#: content/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/advanced/vanity-addresses/
msgid "Vanity Addresses"
msgstr "Adresser för fåfänga"

#: content/onion-services/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Onion services are services that can only be accessed over Tor. Running an "
"Onion Service gives your users all the security of HTTPS with the added "
"privacy benefits of Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänster är tjänster som endast kan nås via Tor. Genom att driva en "
"onion-tjänst ger du användarna hela HTTPS-säkerheten samt de ytterligare "
"integritetsfördelarna med Tor Browser."

#: content/onion-services/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/
msgid "What are Onion Services?"
msgstr "Vad är onion-tjänster?"

#: content/onion-services/contents.lr:page.cta
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/
msgid "Grow your .onion"
msgstr "Låt din .onion växa"

#: content/onion-services/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Onion services help you and your users defeat surveillance and censorship. "
"Learn how you can deploy Onion Services."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänster hjälper dig och dina användare att motstå övervakning och "
"censur. Lär dig hur du kan driftsätta onion-tjänster."

