"If you decide to use a fixed obfs4 port smaller than 1024 (for example 80 or "
"443), you will need to give the Lyrebird executable `CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE` "
"capabilities so it can bind to the port without root privileges."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer en fast obfs4-port under 1024, till exempel 80 eller 443, måste "
"du ge den körbara filen för Lyrebird behörigheten `CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE` så "
"att den kan binda till porten utan root-behörighet."

