"like this, usually in `/var/log/tor/notices.log` (default) or `/var/log/"
"messages` (syslog):"
msgstr ""
"För att bekräfta att bron körs utan problem bör du se något liknande detta, "
"vanligtvis i `/var/log/tor/notices.log` (standard) eller `/var/log/messages` "
"(syslog):"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/
msgid ""
"You can query the currently assigned capabilities by running `getcap /usr/"
"bin/lyrebird`. Should you ever decide to use an unprivileged port, remember "
"to remove the capability with `setcap -r /usr/bin/lyrebird`."
msgstr ""
"Du kan kontrollera de tilldelade behörigheterna genom att köra `getcap /usr/"
"bin/lyrebird`. Om du senare väljer att använda en icke-privilegierad port "
"ska du ta bort behörigheten med `setcap -r /usr/bin/lyrebird`."

