msgstr "Alpine Linux"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/
msgid "1. Install or build apk-autoupdate"
msgstr "1. Installera eller bygg apk-autoupdate"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/
msgid "2. Setup the cron job"
msgstr "2. Konfigurera cron-jobbet"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/
msgid "Clone the repository."
msgstr "Klona kodförrådet."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/
msgid ""
"Configure cron to regularly run `apk-autoupdate`. The crontab line below "
"will run it daily at 2 AM, assuming that the system is running at that time."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera cron så att `apk-autoupdate` körs regelbundet. Raden i crontab "
"nedan kör programmet dagligen klockan 02.00, förutsatt att systemet är igång "
"då."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/
msgid "First, get the build dependencies."
msgstr "Hämta först byggberoendena."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/alpine/updates/
