msgid ""
"Configuring the Tor Project's package repository for Debian/Ubuntu is "
"recommended and documented on **[Support portal](https://"
"support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/)**. Please "
"follow those instructions before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas att konfigurera The Tor Projects paketförråd för Debian/"
"Ubuntu. Anvisningar finns i **[supportportalen](https://"
"support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/)**. Följ dem "
"innan du fortsätter."

