msgstr "Aktivera och starta `tor`:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions to enable [automatic software updates](../../guard/"
"debian-ubuntu/updates/) for your operating system."
msgstr ""
"Följ anvisningarna för att aktivera [automatiska programuppdateringar](../../"
"guard/debian-ubuntu/updates/) i operativsystemet."

