#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
msgid ""
"For more details, see [ticket 18356](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/"
"tor/-/issues/18356)."
msgstr ""
"Mer information finns i [ärende 18356](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/"
"core/tor/-/issues/18356)."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
msgid ""
"If everything worked correctly, you will now have two files `/etc/systemd/"
"system/tor@.service.d/override.conf` and `/etc/systemd/system/"
"tor@default.service.d/override.conf` containing the text you entered."
msgstr ""
"Om allt fungerar har du nu två filer, `/etc/systemd/system/tor@.service.d/"
"override.conf` och `/etc/systemd/system/tor@default.service.d/"
"override.conf`, som innehåller texten du angav."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
msgid ""
"If not, you can [build it from source](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/"
"anti-censorship/pluggable-transports/lyrebird#installation)."
msgstr ""
"Annars kan du [bygga det från källkod](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/"
"anti-censorship/pluggable-transports/lyrebird#installation)."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
