"`obfs4proxy` package is available in unstable, testing, and stable."
msgstr ""
"På [Debian](https://packages.debian.org/search?keywords=obfs4proxy) finns "
"paketet `obfs4proxy` i unstable, testing och stable."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
msgid ""
"On [Ubuntu](https://packages.ubuntu.com/search?keywords=obfs4proxy), bionic, "
"cosmic, disco, eoan, and focal have the package."
msgstr ""
"På [Ubuntu](https://packages.ubuntu.com/search?keywords=obfs4proxy) finns "
"paketet i bionic, cosmic, disco, eoan och focal."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/webtunnel-bridge/source/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/webtunnel/source/
