msgstr "Kör kommandot:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
msgid ""
"There is no need to run `systemctl daemon-reload` because `systemctl edit` "
"does it automatically."
msgstr ""
"Du behöver inte köra `systemctl daemon-reload`, eftersom `systemctl edit` "
"gör det automatiskt."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
msgid ""
"To confirm your bridge is running with no issues, you should see something "
"like this (usually in `/var/log/syslog` or run `# journalctl -e -u "
"tor@default`):"
msgstr ""
"För att bekräfta att bron körs utan problem bör du se något liknande detta, "
"vanligtvis i `/var/log/syslog`. Du kan även köra `# journalctl -e -u "
"tor@default`:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/debian-ubuntu/
msgid ""
"To work around systemd hardening, you will also need to edit and change the "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"För att kringgå systemds säkerhetshärdning behöver du även redigera och "
"ändra konfigurationen."

