msgstr "För att använda den nya bron i Tor Browser behöver du dess ”brorad”."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/docker/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/docker/
msgid ""
"Upgrading to the latest version of our image is as simple as pulling the "
