msgstr ""
"Vi tillhandahåller en docker-compose-fil som hjälper dig att distribuera "
"containern."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/docker/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/docker/
msgid ""
"We will announce new image versions on the [tor-dev](https://"
"lists.torproject.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/tor-dev) mailing list."
msgstr ""
"Vi meddelar nya versioner av avbildningen på e-postlistan [tor-dev](https://"
"lists.torproject.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/tor-dev)."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/docker/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/docker/
msgid ""
"With your bridge configuration in place, you can now deploy the container by "
"running:"
msgstr ""
"När brokonfigurationen är klar kan du distribuera containern genom att köra:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/docker/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/docker/
msgid "You can inspect your bridge's logs by running:"
msgstr "Du kan granska brons loggar genom att köra:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/docker/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/docker/
msgid ""
"You may [download our template .env](https://gitlab.torproject.org/"
"torproject/anti-censorship/docker-obfs4-bridge/raw/main/.env) to get started."
msgstr ""
"Du kan [hämta vår mall för .env](https://gitlab.torproject.org/torproject/"
"anti-censorship/docker-obfs4-bridge/raw/main/.env) för att komma igång."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/docker/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/docker/
msgid ""
"You may set additional torrc variables in your `.env` file by setting "
"`OBFS4_ENABLE_ADDITIONAL_VARIABLES` to 1 and prefixing the desired torrc "
"options with `OBFS4V_`. For example, to set the `AddressDisableIPv6` option, "
"include the following lines in your `.env`:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange ytterligare torrc-variabler i `.env` genom att ställa in "
"`OBFS4_ENABLE_ADDITIONAL_VARIABLES` på 1 och lägga till prefixet `OBFS4V_` "
"framför önskade torrc-alternativ. Inkludera till exempel följande rader i "
"`.env` för att ange alternativet `AddressDisableIPv6`:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/docker/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/docker/
msgid "You should now see output similar to the following:"
msgstr "Nu bör du se utdata som liknar följande:"

