#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
msgid "**DragonflyBSD** has 2 packages repositories:"
msgstr "**DragonFly BSD** har två paketförråd:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid "2. Bootstrap `pkg`"
msgstr "2. Initiera `pkg`"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid "2.1. Recommended steps to setup `pkg`"
msgstr "2.1. Rekommenderade steg för att konfigurera `pkg`"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
msgid ""
"5. Edit your Tor config file, usually located at `/usr/local/etc/tor/torrc` "
"and replace its content with:"
msgstr ""
"5. Redigera Tors konfigurationsfil, som vanligtvis finns i `/usr/local/etc/"
"tor/torrc`, och ersätt innehållet med följande:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid ""
"After applying all these changes, we update the packages list again and try "
"to check if there's already a new update to apply:"
msgstr ""
"När alla ändringar har tillämpats uppdaterar vi paketlistan igen och "
"kontrollerar om det finns någon ny uppdatering att installera:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/
msgid ""
"DragonFlyBSD's daily snapshots and releases (starting with 3.4) come with "
"`pkg` already installed. Upgrades from earlier releases, however, will not "
"have it. If `pkg` is missing on the system for any reason, it can be quickly "
"bootstrapped without having to build it from source or even having "
"**DPorts** installed:"
msgstr ""
"DragonFlyBSD:s dagliga ögonblicksbilder och utgåvor från och med 3.4 "
"levereras med `pkg` installerat. Uppgraderingar från tidigare utgåvor saknar "
"det dock. Om `pkg` av någon anledning saknas kan det snabbt initieras utan "
"att byggas från källkod eller ens kräva att **DPorts** är installerat:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/
msgid ""
"For fresh installations, the file `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/df-"
"latest.conf.sample` is copied to `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/df-latest`. The "
"files ending in the \".sample\" extension are ignored; pkg(8) only reads "
"files that end in \".conf\" and it will read as many as it finds."
msgstr ""
"Vid nya installationer kopieras filen `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/df-"
"latest.conf.sample` till `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/df-latest`. Filer med "
"ändelsen ”.sample” ignoreras. pkg(8) läser endast filer som slutar "
"på ”.conf” och läser alla sådana filer som hittas."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
msgid "Here we can choose to install the latest stable version (recommended):"
msgstr ""
"Här kan vi välja att installera den senaste stabila versionen, vilket "
"rekommenderas:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
msgid ""
"Here, it will be similar to what we have on a **FreeBSD** system, and we are "
"going to use HTTPS to fetch our packages, and updates - so here we also need "
"an extra package to help us out; `ca_root_nss`."
msgstr ""
"Här blir det ungefär som på ett **FreeBSD**-system. Vi använder HTTPS för "
"att hämta paket och uppdateringar och behöver därför även paketet "
"`ca_root_nss`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid "Or install an alpha release:"
msgstr "Eller installera en alfaversion:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
msgid ""
"We can simply edit the **URL** used to point to the repositories on `/usr/"
"local/etc/pkg/repos/df-latest` and that's it! Remember to use **pkg+https://"
"** for Avalon."
msgstr ""
"Vi kan helt enkelt redigera **URL:en** som pekar på paketförråden i `/usr/"
"local/etc/pkg/repos/df-latest`. Kom ihåg att använda **pkg+https://** för "
"Avalon."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/dragonflybsd/
msgid "How to deploy an obfs4 bridge on DragonflyBSD"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du en obfs4-bro på DragonFly BSD"

