msgstr "Om statusen är ”Enforcing” ändrar du den till ”Permissive”:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/fedora/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/fedora/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/fedora/
