"Once you are set configuring the Tor repository, you are now able to install "
"the package:"
msgstr "När Tors paketförråd har konfigurerats kan du installera paketet:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/fedora/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/fedora/
msgid "The package is called `obfs4` and this is all you need to install it:"
msgstr ""
"Paketet heter `obfs4`, och detta är allt du behöver göra för att installera "
"det:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/fedora/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/fedora/
msgid "To make the changes permanent:"
msgstr "Gör ändringarna permanenta:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/fedora/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/fedora/
msgid "How to deploy an obfs4 bridge on Fedora"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du en obfs4-bro på Fedora"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid ""
"5. Edit your Tor config file, usually located at `/usr/local/etc/tor` and "
"replace its content with:"
msgstr ""
"5. Redigera Tors konfigurationsfil, som vanligtvis finns i `/usr/local/etc/"
"tor`, och ersätt innehållet med följande:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid "6. Ensure that the `random_id` sysctl setting is enabled"
msgstr "6. Se till att sysctl-inställningen `random_id` är aktiverad"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
