"Följ anvisningarna för att aktivera [automatiska programuppdateringar](../../"
"guard/freebsd/updates/) i operativsystemet."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/dragonflybsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid "Installing the `ca_root_nss` package:"
msgstr "Installera paketet `ca_root_nss`:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid ""
"One additional step is to prefer using HTTPS to fetch our packages, and "
"updates - so here we also need an extra package to help us out (ca_root_nss)."
msgstr ""
"Ett ytterligare steg är att använda HTTPS för att hämta paket och "
"uppdateringar. Därför behöver vi även paketet ca_root_nss."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid ""
"That means we do not have any packages installed, or even the `pkg` packages "
"manager itself (there's no `sudo` available - we are running commands as "
"root)."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att inga paket är installerade, inte ens pakethanteraren `pkg`. "
"`sudo` finns inte tillgängligt, eftersom kommandona körs som root."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid ""
"This guide assumes we have already a base installation of FreeBSD running, "
"and only the base system."
msgstr ""
"Vägledningen förutsätter att en grundinstallation av FreeBSD redan körs och "
"att endast grundsystemet är installerat."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid ""
"This is how the new configuration file `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/"
"FreeBSD.conf` must look like:"
msgstr ""
"Den nya konfigurationsfilen `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/FreeBSD.conf` ska se "
"ut så här:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid "To bootstrap and install `pkg` we should run the following command:"
msgstr "Kör följande kommando för att initiera och installera `pkg`:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid ""
"To confirm your bridge is running with no issues, you should see something "
"like this in `/var/log/tor/notices.log`:"
msgstr ""
"För att bekräfta att bron körs utan problem bör du se något liknande detta i "
"`/var/log/tor/notices.log`:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid ""
"To follow upstream updates in a \"faster way\" we recommend changing the "
"'quarterly' branch used by `pkg` to its 'latest' branch."
msgstr ""
"För att snabbare få uppströmsuppdateringar rekommenderar vi att grenen "
"”quarterly” som används av `pkg` ändras till ”latest”."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid ""
"We are keeping the original setting used by `pkg` but setting a new one that "
"will override it. So we set up a new directory, and then create a "
"configuration file to override what we need. This configuration file will be "
"`/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/FreeBSD.conf`."
msgstr ""
"Vi behåller den ursprungliga inställningen som används av `pkg`, men lägger "
"till en ny som åsidosätter den. Skapa därför en ny mapp och sedan "
"konfigurationsfilen `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/FreeBSD.conf` med de "
"inställningar som ska åsidosättas."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid "You can choose to install the stable version (recommended):"
msgstr ""
"Du kan välja att installera den stabila versionen, vilket rekommenderas:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/freebsd/
msgid "How to deploy an obfs4 bridge on FreeBSD"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du en obfs4-bro på FreeBSD"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/netbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/netbsd/
msgid "2. Setup `pkg_add`"
msgstr "2. Konfigurera `pkg_add`"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/
msgid ""
"5. Edit your Tor config file, usually located at `/usr/pkg/etc/tor/torrc` "
"and replace its content with:"
msgstr ""
"5. Redigera Tors konfigurationsfil, som vanligtvis finns i `/usr/pkg/etc/tor/"
"torrc`, och ersätt innehållet med följande:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/archlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/archlinux/
msgid ""
"If your bridge is now running, check out the [post-install notes](../../post-"
"install/)."
msgstr ""
"Om bron nu körs bör du läsa [anmärkningarna efter installationen](../../post-"
"install/)."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/netbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/netbsd/
msgid ""
"Modern versions of the NetBSD operating system can be set to use `pkgin`, "
"which is a piece of software aimed to be like `apt` or `yum` for managing "
"pkgsrc binary packages. We are not convering its setup here, and opt to use "
"plain `pkg_add` instead."
msgstr ""
"Moderna versioner av NetBSD kan konfigureras för att använda `pkgin`, ett "
"program som liknar `apt` och `yum` för hantering av binära pkgsrc-paket. Vi "
"beskriver inte konfigureringen här utan använder vanliga `pkg_add`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/
msgid "How to deploy an obfs4 bridge on NetBSD"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du en obfs4-bro på NetBSD"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/contents.lr:page.title
#: content/relay/setup/guard/netbsd/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/netbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/netbsd/
msgid "NetBSD"
msgstr "NetBSD"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "3. Install the obfuscator"
msgstr "3. Installera obfuskeraren"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "3.1 Alternative: build lyrebird from source"
msgstr "3.1 Alternativ: bygg lyrebird från källkod"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "5. Change `openfiles-max` and `maxfiles`"
msgstr "5. Ändra `openfiles-max` och `maxfiles`"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "7. Monitor your logs (usually in your syslog)"
msgstr "7. Övervaka loggarna, vanligtvis i syslog"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/openbsd/
msgid "Append the following section to `/etc/login.conf`:"
msgstr "Lägg till följande avsnitt i `/etc/login.conf`:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "Build the executable and install it to a directory in your `PATH`."
msgstr ""
"Bygg den körbara filen och installera den i en mapp som finns i `PATH`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid ""
"By default, OpenBSD maintains a rather low limit on the maximum number of "
"open files for a process. For a daemon such as Tor's, that opens a "
"connection to each and every other relay (currently around 7000 relays), "
"these limits should be raised."
msgstr ""
"OpenBSD har som standard en ganska låg gräns för hur många filer en process "
"får ha öppna. För en demon som Tor, som öppnar en anslutning till vart och "
"ett av de andra reläerna – för närvarande omkring 7 000 – bör gränserna "
"höjas."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "Clone the repository and `cd` to it."
msgstr "Klona kodförrådet och gå till det med `cd`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions to enable [automatic software updates](../../guard/"
"openbsd/updates/) for your operating system."
msgstr ""
"Följ anvisningarna för att aktivera [automatiska programuppdateringar](../../"
"guard/openbsd/updates/) i operativsystemet."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid ""
"If you're not yet on OpenBSD 7.9, you might want to [build it from source]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/anti-censorship/pluggable-transports/"
"lyrebird)."
msgstr ""
"Om du ännu inte använder OpenBSD 7.9 kan du [bygga det från källkod](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/anti-censorship/pluggable-transports/lyrebird)."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/openbsd/
msgid "Increase it from the default of 7030 to 16000:"
msgstr "Höj värdet från standardvärdet 7030 till 16000:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "Lyrebird is a fork of obfs4proxy maintained by the Tor Project."
msgstr ""
"Lyrebird är en avgrening av obfs4proxy som underhålls av The Tor Project."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/openbsd/
msgid "Now change the login class of the `_tor` user accordingly:"
msgstr "Ändra nu inloggningsklassen för användaren `_tor` på motsvarande sätt:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/openbsd/
msgid ""
"OpenBSD also stores a kernel-level file descriptor limit in the sysctl "
"variable `kern.maxfiles`."
msgstr ""
"OpenBSD lagrar även en gräns för filbeskrivare på kärnnivå i sysctl-"
"variabeln `kern.maxfiles`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "Optionally checkout the latest version tag (e.g. `lyrebird-X.X.X`)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan välja att checka ut den senaste versionstaggen, till exempel "
"`lyrebird-X.X.X`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "Since OpenBSD 7.9, there is a lyrebird package."
msgstr "Sedan OpenBSD 7.9 finns ett paket för lyrebird."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "The `go` package is a build dependency."
msgstr "Paketet `go` behövs för att bygga programmet."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
msgid ""
"To confirm your bridge is running with no issues, you should see something "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"För att bekräfta att bron körs utan problem bör du se något liknande detta:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/openbsd/
msgid "How to deploy an obfs4 bridge on OpenBSD"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du en obfs4-bro på OpenBSD"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
msgid "3. Build lyrebird (obfs4proxy) and move it into place"
msgstr "3. Bygg lyrebird (obfs4proxy) och flytta filen till rätt plats"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
msgid ""
"4. Edit your Tor config file, usually located at `/usr/local/etc/tor` and "
"replace its content with:"
msgstr ""
"4. Redigera Tors konfigurationsfil, som vanligtvis finns i `/usr/local/etc/"
"tor`, och ersätt innehållet med följande:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
msgid "5. Restart tor"
msgstr "5. Starta om Tor"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
msgid "6. Monitor your logs (usually in your syslog)"
msgstr "6. Övervaka loggarna, vanligtvis i syslog"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/freebsd/
msgid "7. Final Notes"
msgstr "7. Avslutande anmärkningar"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
msgid ""
"Heavily outdated versions of git can make `go install` fail, so try "
"upgrading to a more recent git version if you're running into this problem."
msgstr ""
"Mycket gamla versioner av Git kan göra att `go install` misslyckas. Prova "
"därför att uppgradera till en nyare Git-version om du stöter på problemet."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
msgid "How to deploy an obfs4 bridge on OpenSUSE"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du en obfs4-bro på openSUSE"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/opensuse/
msgid "OpenSUSE"
msgstr "OpenSUSE"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"BridgeDB uses six buckets for bridge distribution: HTTPS, Moat, Email, "
"Telegram, Settings, and manual."
msgstr ""
"BridgeDB använder sex kanaler för brodistribution: HTTPS, Moat, e-post, "
"Telegram, inställningar och manuell distribution."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid "Congrats!"
msgstr "Grattis!"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"Finally, there aren't many bridge users out there, so you cannot expect your "
"bridge to be as popular as a relay."
msgstr ""
"Det finns inte särskilt många broanvändare, så du kan inte förvänta dig att "
"bron blir lika välanvänd som ett relä."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"Finally, you can monitor your obfs4 bridge's usage on [Relay Search](https://"
"metrics.torproject.org/rs.html#search)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan övervaka användningen av obfs4-bron i [Relay Search](https://"
"metrics.torproject.org/rs.html#search)."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"If you get to this point, it means that your obfs4 bridge is running and is "
"being distributed by BridgeDB to censored users."
msgstr ""
"Om du har kommit så här långt innebär det att obfs4-bron körs och "
"distribueras av BridgeDB till censurerade användare."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"If you want to connect to your bridge manually, you will need to know the "
"bridge's obfs4 certificate."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill ansluta manuellt till bron behöver du känna till brons obfs4-"
"certifikat."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"Just enter your bridge's `<HASHED FINGERPRINT>` in the form and click "
"\"Search\". After having set up the bridge, it takes approximately three "
"hours for the bridge to show up in Relay Search."
msgstr ""
"Ange brons `<HASHED FINGERPRINT>` i formuläret och klicka på ”Search”. När "
"bron har konfigurerats tar det ungefär tre timmar innan den visas i Relay "
"Search."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"Note that it can take several days or weeks until you see a consistent set "
"of users, so don't get discouraged if you don't see user connections right "
"away."
msgstr ""
"Det kan ta flera dagar eller veckor innan du ser ett jämnt antal användare. "
"Bli därför inte avskräckt om inga användaranslutningar syns direkt."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"Or when using Docker, use the following command to retrieve the bridge line:"
msgstr "Om du använder Docker hämtar du broraden med följande kommando:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid "Paste the entire bridge line into Tor Browser:"
msgstr "Klistra in hela broraden i Tor Browser:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"See the file `obfs4_bridgeline.txt`, which is found inside Tor Data "
"Directory, for example, in Debian/Ubuntu `/var/lib/tor/pt_state/"
"obfs4_bridgeline.txt` or FreeBSD `/var/db/tor/pt_state/obfs4_bridgeline.txt`."
msgstr ""
"Se filen `obfs4_bridgeline.txt` i Tors datamapp, till exempel `/var/lib/tor/"
"pt_state/obfs4_bridgeline.txt` i Debian/Ubuntu eller `/var/db/tor/pt_state/"
"obfs4_bridgeline.txt` i FreeBSD."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"Some buckets are used more than others, which also affects the time until "
"your bridge sees users."
msgstr ""
"Vissa distributionskanaler används mer än andra, vilket också påverkar hur "
"lång tid det tar innan bron får användare."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"You can manually [change your bridge distribution method](https://"
"support.torproject.org/relay-operators/change-bridge-distribution/)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan manuellt [ändra brons distributionsmetod](https://"
"support.torproject.org/relay-operators/change-bridge-distribution/)."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid ""
"You'll need to replace `<IP ADDRESS>`, `<PORT>`, and `<FINGERPRINT>` with "
"the actual values, which you can find in the tor log. Make sure to use your "
"server's identity key fingerprint for `<FINGERPRINT>`, not `<HASHED "
"FINGERPRINT>` or the ed25519 key; and that `<PORT>` is the obfs4 port you "
"chose - and not the OR port."
msgstr ""
"Ersätt `<IP ADDRESS>`, `<PORT>` och `<FINGERPRINT>` med de faktiska värdena, "
"som finns i Tor-loggen. Använd fingeravtrycket för serverns identitetsnyckel "
"som `<FINGERPRINT>`, inte `<HASHED FINGERPRINT>` eller ed25519-nyckeln. Se "
"också till att `<PORT>` är obfs4-porten som du valde och inte OR-porten."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid "How to find your bridge in Relay Search and connect manually"
msgstr "Så hittar du bron i Relay Search och ansluter manuellt"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/post-install/
msgid "Post-install"
msgstr "Efter installationen"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
msgid "3. Install obfs4proxy"
msgstr "3. Installera obfs4proxy"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
msgid "6. Monitor your logs"
msgstr "6. Övervaka loggarna"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/voidlinux/
msgid ""
"Different from most recent distributions, Void Linux does not uses "
"**systemd**; it uses [runit](https://man.voidlinux.org/runit.8) instead."
msgstr ""
"Till skillnad från de flesta moderna distributioner använder Void Linux inte "
"**systemd**, utan [runit](https://man.voidlinux.org/runit.8)."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
msgid ""
"Once we can rely on an official `obfs4proxy` package provided by the Void "
"Linux's maintainers, this is how we install it:"
msgstr ""
"När vi kan förlita oss på ett officiellt paket för `obfs4proxy` från Void "
"Linux underhållare installerar vi det så här:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/voidlinux/
msgid ""
"Once you enabled the service, it will automatically start. If you already "
"started the `tor` daemon before and made changes do its configurations, you "
"can restart it with:"
msgstr ""
"När du har aktiverat tjänsten startas den automatiskt. Om du redan har "
"startat demonen `tor` och sedan ändrat konfigurationen kan du starta om den "
"med:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/guard/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/voidlinux/
msgid "To enable `tor`'s service on a booted system:"
msgstr "Aktivera tjänsten `tor` i ett startat system:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
msgid ""
"To install the `tor` package on Void Linux, considering you are already on "
"an up-to-date system:"
msgstr ""
"Om systemet redan är uppdaterat installerar du paketet `tor` på Void Linux "
"så här:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
msgid "How to deploy an obfs4 bridge on Void Linux"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du en obfs4-bro på Void Linux"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.title
#: content/relay/setup/guard/voidlinux/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/voidlinux/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/voidlinux/
msgid "Void Linux"
msgstr "Void Linux"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"**Note: You should only run a Windows bridge if you can run it 24/7. If the "
"operator is unable to guarantee that, a [Snowflake](https://"
"snowflake.torproject.org/) is a better way to contribute resources.**"
msgstr ""
"**Obs! Du bör endast driva en Windows-bro om den kan vara igång dygnet runt. "
"Om du inte kan garantera detta är en [Snowflake](https://"
"snowflake.torproject.org/)-proxy ett bättre sätt att bidra med resurser.**"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "1. Download the Windows Expert Bundle and the Tor Browser"
msgstr "1. Hämta Windows Expert Bundle och Tor Browser"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "2. Build files and relocate"
msgstr "2. Skapa filer och flytta dem"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "3. Create and edit your Tor config file"
msgstr "3. Skapa och redigera Tors konfigurationsfil"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "4. Start Tor"
msgstr "4. Starta Tor"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "5. Monitor your logs"
msgstr "5. Övervaka loggarna"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "6. Final notes"
msgstr "6. Avslutande anmärkningar"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"Don't forget to change the `ORPort`, `ServerTransportListenAddr`, "
"`ContactInfo`, `<user>`, and `Nickname` options."
msgstr ""
"Glöm inte att ändra alternativen `ORPort`, `ServerTransportListenAddr`, "
"`ContactInfo`, `<user>` och `Nickname`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"Double-click on the `torrc` file. When prompted *How do you want to open "
"this file?*, select `Notepad`. Add the following:"
msgstr ""
"Dubbelklicka på filen `torrc`. När frågan *Hur vill du öppna den här filen?* "
"visas väljer du `Anteckningar`. Lägg till följande:"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"From the Tor folder on your desktop, select all `.dll`'s and `.exe`'s and "
"cut/paste them into the `C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\` folder."
msgstr ""
"Markera alla `.dll`- och `.exe`-filer i Tor-mappen på skrivbordet och klipp "
"ut och klistra in dem i mappen `C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"If your bridge is behind a firewall or NAT, make sure to open both ports."
msgstr "Om bron finns bakom en brandvägg eller NAT måste båda portarna öppnas."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"In the `C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\` folder, right-click on "
"white space and select `New > Text Document`. Name the file `torrc`; there "
"is no extension."
msgstr ""
"Högerklicka på ett tomt område i mappen `C:"
"\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\` och välj `Nytt > Textdokument`. Ge "
"filen namnet `torrc` utan filändelse."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"Navigate to `C:\\Users\\<user>\\Desktop\\Tor "
"Browser\\Browser\\TorBrowser\\Tor\\PluggableTransports`. Select "
"`lyrebird.exe` and cut/paste it into the `C:"
"\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\` folder."
msgstr ""
"Gå till `C:\\Users\\<user>\\Desktop\\Tor "
"Browser\\Browser\\TorBrowser\\Tor\\PluggableTransports`. Markera "
"`lyrebird.exe`, klipp ut filen och klistra in den i mappen `C:"
"\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "Note that both Tor's OR port and its obfs4 port must be reachable."
msgstr "Observera att både Tors OR-port och obfs4-port måste vara nåbara."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"Open up the Command Prompt App. Change your directory with: `cd C:"
"\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\`. Type: `tor.exe -f torrc`."
msgstr ""
"Öppna Kommandotolken. Byt mapp med `cd C:"
"\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\`. Skriv sedan `tor.exe -f torrc`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"Open up the Data folder on your desktop. Inside that Tor folder, select both "
"`geoip` and `geoip6` and cut/paste them into the `C:"
"\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\` folder."
msgstr ""
"Öppna mappen Data på skrivbordet. Markera filerna `geoip` och `geoip6` i Tor-"
"mappen, klipp ut dem och klistra in dem i mappen `C:"
"\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"Open up the Tor folder on your desktop. Double click `tor.exe`. Once the "
"command prompt reads: `[notice] Bootstrapped 100% (done): Done`, close the "
"window. This creates the folder `C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\` "
"(where `<user>` is your user name)."
msgstr ""
"Öppna Tor-mappen på skrivbordet och dubbelklicka på `tor.exe`. När "
"Kommandotolken visar `[notice] Bootstrapped 100% (done): Done` stänger du "
"fönstret. Då skapas mappen `C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\`, där "
"`<user>` är ditt användarnamn."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"To confirm your bridge is running with no issues, you should see something "
"like this in `C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\notice.log`."
msgstr ""
"För att bekräfta att bron körs utan problem bör du se något liknande detta i "
"`C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\tor\\notice.log`."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "Use a fixed obfs4 port larger than 1024, still avoiding 9001."
msgstr "Använd en fast obfs4-port över 1024 och undvik fortfarande port 9001."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"You can use [our reachability test](https://bridges.torproject.org/scan/) to "
"see if your obfs4 port is reachable from the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda [vårt nåbarhetstest](https://bridges.torproject.org/scan/) "
"för att kontrollera om obfs4-porten kan nås från internet."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"You will need to show hidden items and file name extensions. In your "
"Explorer window, in the top-left, click on the View tab. In the Show/hide "
"section furthest to the right, check the checkbox for Hidden items; check "
"the checkbox for File name extensions."
msgstr ""
"Du behöver visa dolda objekt och filnamnstillägg. Klicka på fliken Visa uppe "
"till vänster i Utforskaren. Markera Dolda objekt och Filnamnstillägg i "
"avsnittet Visa/dölj längst till höger."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"[Tor Browser (version depends on your computer)](https://www.torproject.org/"
"download/languages/). Run the `.exe` and install with default settings."
msgstr ""
"[Tor Browser, med en version som passar datorn](https://www.torproject.org/"
"download/languages/). Kör `.exe`-filen och installera med "
"standardinställningarna."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid ""
"[Windows Expert Bundle](https://www.torproject.org/download/tor/). Unzip the "
"contents on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"[Windows Expert Bundle](https://www.torproject.org/download/tor/). Packa upp "
"innehållet på skrivbordet."

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
msgid "How to deploy an obfs4 bridge on Windows"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du en obfs4-bro i Windows"

#: content/relay/setup/bridge/windows/contents.lr:page.title
#: content/relay/setup/guard/windows/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/bridge/windows/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/windows/
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"(\"ORPort\" configuration: We recommend port 443 if that is not used by "
"another daemon on your server already."
msgstr ""
"(Konfiguration av ”ORPort”: Vi rekommenderar port 443 om ingen annan demon "
"på servern redan använder den."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid "(More ports usually means potentially more abuse complaints.)"
msgstr "(Fler portar innebär vanligtvis fler möjliga missbruksanmälningar.)"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"Click below on type of relay do you want to host and don't forget to read "
"[Relay post-install and good practices](post-install/)."
msgstr ""
"Klicka nedan på den typ av relä du vill vara värd för och glöm inte att läsa "
"[Efter installationen och god praxis för reläer](post-install/)."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid "Do you want to run a Tor exit or non-exit (bridge/guard/middle) relay?"
msgstr ""
"Vill du driva ett Tor-utgångsrelä eller ett icke-utgångsrelä, såsom en bro, "
"vakt eller ett mellanrelä?"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid "Does the server have an IPv6 address?"
msgstr "Har servern en IPv6-adress?"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"How much bandwidth/monthly traffic do you want to allow for Tor traffic?"
msgstr ""
"Hur mycket bandbredd eller månatlig trafik vill du tillåta för Tor-trafik?"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"If you are looking to run a relay with minimal effort, we recommend you "
"stick to stable releases."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill driva ett relä med så liten arbetsinsats som möjligt "
"rekommenderar vi stabila utgåvor."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"If you want to run an exit relay: Which ports do you want to allow in your "
"exit policy?"
msgstr ""
"Om du vill driva ett utgångsrelä: Vilka portar vill du tillåta i "
"utgångspolicyn?"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"Note: For some operating systems, there are alpha version packages available "
"(Tor versions with new features not deemed to be stable yet)."
msgstr ""
"Obs! För vissa operativsystem finns paket med alfaversioner, det vill säga "
"Tor-versioner med nya funktioner som ännu inte bedöms vara stabila."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"ORPort 443 is recommended because it is often one of the few open ports on "
"public WIFI networks."
msgstr ""
"ORPort 443 rekommenderas eftersom den ofta är en av få öppna portar i "
"offentliga Wi-Fi-nätverk."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid "Port 9001 is another commonly used ORPort.)"
msgstr "Port 9001 är en annan vanlig ORPort.)"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid "Questions you should clarify before configuring Tor"
msgstr "Frågor att klargöra innan Tor konfigureras"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"The installation commands are shown in code blocks and must be executed with "
"root privileges."
msgstr ""
"Installationskommandona visas i kodblock och måste köras med root-behörighet."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"These are only recommended for people eager to test and report bugs in "
"bleeding edge releases/features."
msgstr ""
"De rekommenderas endast för personer som gärna testar och rapporterar fel i "
"de allra senaste utgåvorna och funktionerna."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"These steps are intended for the latest stable version of the given OS, on "
"Ubuntu for the latest LTS release."
msgstr ""
"Stegen gäller den senaste stabila versionen av respektive operativsystem och "
"den senaste LTS-versionen av Ubuntu."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid "This information will be made public."
msgstr "Informationen kommer att offentliggöras."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"This section covers the installation and configuration of the program "
"required to run a Tor relay for various operating systems."
msgstr ""
"Det här avsnittet beskriver installation och konfiguration av programmet som "
"krävs för att driva ett Tor-relä på olika operativsystem."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"What email address will you use in the ContactInfo field of your relay(s)?"
msgstr ""
"Vilken e-postadress ska du använda i fältet ContactInfo för reläet eller "
"reläerna?"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid "What external TCP port do you want to use for incoming Tor connections?"
msgstr ""
"Vilken extern TCP-port vill du använda för inkommande Tor-anslutningar?"

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid ""
"How to install and configure each type of relay: bridge, guard, middle, and "
"exit."
msgstr ""
"Så installerar och konfigurerar du varje relätyp: bro, vakt, mellanrelä och "
"utgångsrelä."

#: content/relay/setup/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/
msgid "Technical Setup"
msgstr "Teknisk installation"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid "2. Lock changes in"
msgstr "2. Lås ändringarna"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid "3. QNAME minimisation"
msgstr "3. QNAME-minimering"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid "4. Start the service"
msgstr "4. Starta tjänsten"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid "If the setting is missing, it should still be enabled by default."
msgstr "Om inställningen saknas bör den ändå vara aktiverad som standard."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid ""
"If you are running **systemd-resolved** with its stub listener, you may need "
"to do a bit more than just that. Please refer to the [resolved.conf manpage]"
"(https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/resolved.conf.html)."
msgstr ""
"Om du kör **systemd-resolved** med dess stubblyssnare kan du behöva göra mer "
"än så. Se [manualsidan för resolved.conf](https://www.freedesktop.org/"
"software/systemd/man/resolved.conf.html)."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
msgid ""
"If you are using a legacy version of CentOS/RHEL, using `yum` instead of "
"`dnf` may be more suitable."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder en äldre version av CentOS/RHEL kan det vara lämpligare att "
"använda `yum` i stället för `dnf`."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid "The Unbound resolver you just installed also does DNSSEC validation."
msgstr "Unbound-resolvern som du just installerade validerar även DNSSEC."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid ""
"The following commands install `unbound`, backup your DNS configuration, and "
"tell the system to use the local resolver:"
msgstr ""
"Följande kommandon installerar `unbound`, säkerhetskopierar DNS-"
"konfigurationen och anger att systemet ska använda den lokala resolveraren:"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid ""
"The latest versions of `unbound` have `qname-minimisation` enabled by "
"default. However, it is advisable to verify this setting, as older versions "
"did not enable it automatically."
msgstr ""
"I de senaste versionerna av `unbound` är `qname-minimisation` aktiverat som "
"standard. Kontrollera ändå inställningen, eftersom den inte aktiverades "
"automatiskt i äldre versioner."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
msgid ""
"To avoid unwanted configuration changes (for example by the DHCP client):"
msgstr ""
"För att förhindra oönskade konfigurationsändringar, till exempel från DHCP-"
"klienten:"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid ""
"To check and configure it, open the unbound configuration file, located at `/"
"etc/unbound/unbound.conf`, look for the following entry and change it if "
"necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Öppna Unbounds konfigurationsfil `/etc/unbound/unbound.conf`, leta efter "
"följande post och ändra den vid behov för att kontrollera och konfigurera "
"inställningen:"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid "To enable and start the `unbound` service, run:"
msgstr "Aktivera och starta tjänsten `unbound` genom att köra:"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.section
#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.section
#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.section
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.section
#: content/relay/types-of-relays/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/types-of-relays/
msgid "Exit relay"
msgstr "Exit-relä"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
msgid "How to install Unbound on CentOS/RHEL"
msgstr "Så installerar du Unbound på CentOS/RHEL"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.title
#: content/relay/setup/guard/centos-rhel/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/centos-rhel/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/centos-rhel/
msgid "CentOS/RHEL"
msgstr "CentOS/RHEL"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"After switching to Unbound, verify that it works as expected by resolving a "
"valid hostname. If it does not work, you can restore your old `/etc/"
"resolv.conf` file."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera att Unbound fungerar som förväntat efter bytet genom att slå upp "
"ett giltigt värdnamn. Om det inte fungerar kan du återställa den gamla filen "
"`/etc/resolv.conf`."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"As a new exit relay - especially if you are new to your hoster - it is good "
"to start with a reduced exit policy (to reduce the amount of abuse emails) "
"and further open it up as you become more experienced."
msgstr ""
"Som ny operatör av ett utgångsrelä, särskilt om du är ny hos "
"värdleverantören, är det klokt att börja med en begränsad utgångspolicy för "
"att minska antalet missbruksmeddelanden och sedan öppna den ytterligare när "
"du har fått mer erfarenhet."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Avoid adding more than two resolvers to your `/etc/resolv.conf` file to "
"limit AS-level exposure of DNS queries."
msgstr ""
"Lägg inte till fler än två resolvrar i `/etc/resolv.conf`, så att DNS-"
"frågornas exponering på AS-nivå begränsas."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Before turning your non-exit relay into an exit relay, ensure that you have "
"set a reverse DNS record (PTR) to make it more obvious that this is a tor "
"exit relay. Something like \"tor-exit\" in its name is a good start."
msgstr ""
"Innan du omvandlar ett icke-utgångsrelä till ett utgångsrelä bör du ange en "
"omvänd DNS-post (PTR) som tydligt visar att det är ett Tor-utgångsrelä. Ett "
"namn som innehåller ”tor-exit” är en bra början."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Below are instructions on how to install and configure **Unbound** - a "
"DNSSEC-validating and caching resolver - on your exit relay. Unbound has "
"many configuration and tuning knobs, but we keep these instructions simple "
"and short; the basic setup will do just fine for most operators."
msgstr ""
"Nedan finns anvisningar för att installera och konfigurera **Unbound**, en "
"cachelagrande resolver som validerar DNSSEC, på utgångsreläet. Unbound har "
"många konfigurations- och finjusteringsalternativ, men vi håller "
"anvisningarna enkla och korta. Grundkonfigurationen fungerar bra för de "
"flesta operatörer."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"By using your own DNS resolver, you are less vulnerable to DNS-based "
"censorship that your upstream resolver might impose."
msgstr ""
"Med en egen DNS-resolver blir du mindre sårbar för DNS-baserad censur som en "
"uppströmsresolver kan tillämpa."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid "DNS on Exit Relays"
msgstr "DNS på utgångsreläer"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"DNS resolution can have a significant impact on the performance and "
"reliability that your exit relay provides."
msgstr ""
"DNS-uppslagning kan ha stor inverkan på utgångsreläets prestanda och "
"tillförlitlighet."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"DNS resolution on exit relays is crucial for Tor clients and it should be "
"reliable and fast by using caching."
msgstr ""
"DNS-uppslagning på utgångsreläer är avgörande för Tor-klienter och bör vara "
"tillförlitlig och snabb genom användning av cachelagring."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Defining the [exit policy](https://www.torproject.org/docs/tor-"
"manual.html.en#ExitPolicy) is one of the most important parts of an exit "
"relay configuration."
msgstr ""
"Att definiera [utgångspolicyn](https://www.torproject.org/docs/tor-"
"manual.html.en#ExitPolicy) är en av de viktigaste delarna av konfigurationen "
"av ett utgångsrelä."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid "Do not mix your own traffic with your exit relay traffic."
msgstr "Blanda inte din egen trafik med utgångsreläets trafik."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Do use a domain name that you own. Definitely do not use `torproject.org` as "
"a domain name for your reverse DNS."
msgstr ""
"Använd ett domännamn som du äger. Använd absolut inte `torproject.org` som "
"domännamn för omvänd DNS."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Don't use any of the big DNS resolvers (Google, OpenDNS, Quad9, Cloudflare, "
"4.2.2.1-6) as your primary or fallback DNS resolver to avoid centralization."
msgstr ""
"Använd inte någon av de stora DNS-resolvrarna, såsom Google, OpenDNS, Quad9, "
"Cloudflare eller 4.2.2.1–6, som primär resolver eller reservresolver. Det "
"motverkar centralisering."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Ensure your local resolver does not use any outbound source IP address that "
"is used by any Tor exit or non-exits, because it is not uncommon that Tor "
"IPs are (temporarily) blocked and a blocked DNS resolver source IP address "
"can have a broad impact."
msgstr ""
"Se till att den lokala resolveraren inte använder någon utgående käll-IP-"
"adress som används av ett Tor-utgångsrelä eller icke-utgångsrelä. Tor-IP-"
"adresser blockeras inte sällan tillfälligt, och en blockerad käll-IP-adress "
"för en DNS-resolver kan få omfattande konsekvenser."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid "Exit Notice HTML page"
msgstr "HTML-sida med meddelande om utgångsrelä"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid "Exit policy"
msgstr "Utgångspolicy"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"For more information read its [release notes](https://blog.torproject.org/"
"node/2041) and [ticket #40282](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/tor/-/"
"issues/40282)."
msgstr ""
"Mer information finns i [versionsinformationen](https://blog.torproject.org/"
"node/2041) och [ärende 40282](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/tor/-/"
"issues/40282)."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"For unbound you can use the `outgoing-interface` option to specify the "
"source IP addresses for contacting other DNS servers."
msgstr ""
"I Unbound kan du använda alternativet `outgoing-interface` för att ange käll-"
"IP-adresserna som används vid kontakt med andra DNS-servrar."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"If a local resolver like unbound is not an option for you, use a resolver "
"that your provider runs in the same autonomous system (to find out if an IP "
"address is in the same AS as your relay, you can look it up using "
"[bgp.he.net](https://bgp.he.net))."
msgstr ""
"Om en lokal resolver som Unbound inte är ett alternativ kan du använda en "
"resolver som leverantören driver i samma autonoma system. Du kan kontrollera "
"om en IP-adress finns i samma AS som reläet via [bgp.he.net](https://"
"bgp.he.net)."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"If you didn't set this up before, the following configuration lines must be "
"applied to your `torrc`:"
msgstr ""
"Om du inte redan har konfigurerat detta måste följande rader läggas till i "
"`torrc`:"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"If you want to add a second DNS resolver as a fallback to your `/etc/"
"resolv.conf` configuration, choose a resolver within your autonomous system "
"and make sure that it is not your first entry in that file (the first entry "
"should be your local resolver)."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill lägga till en andra DNS-resolver som reserv i `/etc/resolv.conf` "
"väljer du en resolver i ditt autonoma system. Se till att den inte är den "
"första posten i filen, eftersom den första ska vara den lokala resolveraren."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"If you want to be a useful exit relay you must **at least allow destination "
"ports 80 and 443**."
msgstr ""
"För att vara ett användbart utgångsrelä måste du **åtminstone tillåta "
"målportarna 80 och 443**."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"If your provider offers it, make sure your [WHOIS](https://whois.icann.org/"
"en/about-whois) record contains clear indications that this is a Tor exit "
"relay."
msgstr ""
"Om leverantören erbjuder det bör [WHOIS-posten](https://whois.icann.org/en/"
"about-whois) tydligt ange att detta är ett Tor-utgångsrelä."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Install the resolver software over your operating system's package manager, "
"to ensure that it is updated automatically."
msgstr ""
"Installera resolverprogramvaran via operativsystemets pakethanterare så att "
"den uppdateras automatiskt."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"It is not recommended to install Tor exit relays on servers that you need "
"for other services as well."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas inte att installera Tor-utgångsreläer på servrar som även "
"behövs för andra tjänster."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"It is recommended that you setup exit relays on servers dedicated to this "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"Vi rekommenderar att utgångsreläer konfigureras på servrar som är avsedda "
"för ändamålet."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Large exit operators (>=100 Mbit/s) should make an effort to monitor and "
"optimize Tor's DNS resolution timeout rate."
msgstr ""
"Stora utgångsoperatörer (≥100 Mbit/s) bör övervaka och optimera "
"tidsgränsfrekvensen för Tors DNS-uppslagningar."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Note: **DirPort** is deprecated since Tor 0.4.6.5, and self-tests are no "
"longer being showed on `tor`'s logs."
msgstr ""
"Obs! **DirPort** är föråldrat sedan Tor 0.4.6.5, och självtester visas inte "
"längre i `tor`-loggarna."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid "Reverse DNS and WHOIS record"
msgstr "Omvänd DNS- och WHOIS-post"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"The exit policy defines which destination ports you are willing to forward."
msgstr ""
"Utgångspolicyn anger vilka målportar du är villig att vidarebefordra trafik "
"till."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"The following metric can be used to monitor the timeout rate as seen by Tor:"
msgstr ""
"Följande mätvärde kan användas för att övervaka tidsgränsfrekvensen som Tor "
"ser den:"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"The reduced exit policy can be found on the [Reduced Exit Policy](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/ReducedExitPolicy) wiki page."
msgstr ""
"Den begränsade utgångspolicyn finns på wikisidan [Reduced Exit Policy]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/ReducedExitPolicy)."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"There are multiple options for DNS server software. [Unbound](https://"
"nlnetlabs.nl/projects/unbound/about/) has become"
msgstr ""
"Det finns flera alternativ för DNS-serverprogramvara. [Unbound](https://"
"nlnetlabs.nl/projects/unbound/about/) har blivit"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid "This can be achieved via Tor's Prometheus exporter (`MetricsPort`)."
msgstr "Det kan göras via Tors Prometheus-exportör (`MetricsPort`)."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"This file will be shown to anyone directing their browser to your Tor exit "
"relay IP address."
msgstr ""
"Filen visas för alla som öppnar Tor-utgångsreläets IP-adress i en webbläsare."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"This has an impact on the amount of abuse emails you will get (less ports "
"means less abuse emails, but an exit relay allowing only few ports is also "
"less useful)."
msgstr ""
"Det påverkar hur många missbruksmeddelanden du får. Färre portar innebär "
"färre meddelanden, men ett utgångsrelä som endast tillåter ett fåtal portar "
"är också mindre användbart."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"To become an exit relay change **ExitRelay** from 0 to 1 in your `torrc` "
"configuration file and restart the `tor` daemon."
msgstr ""
"Ändra **ExitRelay** från 0 till 1 i konfigurationsfilen `torrc` och starta "
"om demonen `tor` för att göra reläet till ett utgångsrelä."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"To make it even more obvious that this is a Tor exit relay you should serve "
"a Tor exit notice HTML page."
msgstr ""
"För att göra det ännu tydligare att detta är ett Tor-utgångsrelä bör du "
"tillhandahålla en HTML-sida med ett meddelande om utgångsreläet."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Tor can do that for you: if your **DirPort** is on TCP port 80, you can make "
"use of `tor`'s **DirPortFrontPage** feature to display an HTML file on that "
"port."
msgstr ""
"Tor kan göra det åt dig: om **DirPort** använder TCP-port 80 kan du använda "
"funktionen **DirPortFrontPage** i `tor` för att visa en HTML-fil på porten."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"Unlike other types of relays, exit relays also do DNS resolution for Tor "
"clients."
msgstr ""
"Till skillnad från andra relätyper utför utgångsreläer även DNS-uppslagning "
"åt Tor-klienter."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"We also have a great blog post with some more [tips for running an exit "
"relay](https://blog.torproject.org/tips-running-exit-node)."
msgstr ""
"Vi har också ett bra blogginlägg med fler [tips om att driva ett utgångsrelä]"
"(https://blog.torproject.org/tips-running-exit-node)."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"We assume you read through the [relay guide](..) and [technical "
"considerations](../../technical-considerations/) already. This subpage is "
"for operators that want to turn on exiting on their relay."
msgstr ""
"Vi förutsätter att du redan har läst [relävägledningen](..) och [de tekniska "
"övervägandena](../../technical-considerations/). Den här undersidan är "
"avsedd för operatörer som vill aktivera utgångstrafik på sitt relä."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"We offer a [sample Tor exit notice HTML file](https://gitweb.torproject.org/"
"tor.git/plain/contrib/operator-tools/tor-exit-notice.html), but you might "
"want to adjust it to your needs."
msgstr ""
"Vi erbjuder ett [exempel på en HTML-sida med meddelande om Tor-utgångsrelä]"
"(https://gitweb.torproject.org/tor.git/plain/contrib/operator-tools/tor-exit-"
"notice.html), men du kan anpassa den efter dina behov."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"We recommend running a local caching and DNSSEC-validating resolver without "
"using any forwarders (specific instructions follow below, for various "
"operating systems)."
msgstr ""
"Vi rekommenderar att du kör en lokal cachelagrande resolver som validerar "
"DNSSEC utan att använda vidarebefordrare. Särskilda anvisningar för olika "
"operativsystem finns nedan."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"When choosing your DNS resolver software, make sure that it supports DNSSEC "
"validation and QNAME minimization (RFC7816)."
msgstr ""
"Se till att DNS-resolverprogramvaran stöder DNSSEC-validering och QNAME-"
"minimering (RFC 7816)."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid ""
"a popular one but feel free to use any other software that you are "
"comfortable with."
msgstr ""
"ett populärt alternativ, men du kan använda annan programvara som du känner "
"dig bekväm med."

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid "How to deploy an Exit Relay"
msgstr "Så distribuerar du ett utgångsrelä"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/
msgid "Exit Relay"
msgstr "Exit-relä"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/opensuse/
msgid ""
"To avoid unwanted configuration changed (for example by the DHCP client):"
msgstr ""
"För att förhindra oönskade konfigurationsändringar, till exempel från DHCP-"
"klienten:"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
msgid "How to install Unbound on Debian/Ubuntu"
msgstr "Så installerar du Unbound på Debian/Ubuntu"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.title
#: content/relay/setup/guard/debian-ubuntu/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/debian-ubuntu/
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/guard/debian-ubuntu/
msgid "Debian/Ubuntu"
msgstr "Debian/Ubuntu"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
msgid ""
"FreeBSD ships unbound in the base system but the one in ports is usually "
"following upstream more closely. Install the unbound package, backup your "
"DNS configuration, and tell the system to use the local resolver:"
msgstr ""
"FreeBSD levereras med Unbound i grundsystemet, men versionen i ports följer "
"vanligtvis uppströmsprojektet närmare. Installera paketet unbound, "
"säkerhetskopiera DNS-konfigurationen och ange att systemet ska använda den "
"lokala resolveraren:"

#: content/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/exit/freebsd/
msgid ""
"To check and configure it, open the unbound configuration file, located at `/"
"usr/local/etc/unbound/unbound.conf`, look for the following entry and change "
