#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/
msgid ""
"This Ansible role will install, configure, and operate Snowflake standalone "
"proxy."
msgstr ""
"Ansible-rollen installerar, konfigurerar och driver en fristående Snowflake-"
"proxy."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/
