"`client`."
msgstr ""
"Du kan begränsa antalet klienter, alltså Snowflake-användare, med variabeln "
"`client`."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/
msgid "You can run it as root:"
msgstr "Du kan köra den som root:"

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/
msgid "How to run a standalone Snowflake proxy with Ansible role"
msgstr "Så kör du en fristående Snowflake-proxy med en Ansible-roll"

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/ansible/
msgid "Ansible role"
msgstr "Ansible-roll"

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid ""
"2. A full-cone NAT (you can use this [NAT behaviour tool](https://github.com/"
"pion/stun/tree/master/cmd/stun-nat-behaviour) to test what type of NAT you "
"have."
msgstr ""
"2. En fullkon-NAT. Du kan använda det här [verktyget för NAT-beteende]"
"(https://github.com/pion/stun/tree/master/cmd/stun-nat-behaviour) för att "
"testa vilken typ av NAT du har."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid ""
"3. A server behind no or unrestricted NAT, with incoming UDP on the whole "
"port range of `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range` open (or the "
"range set using the optional `-ephemeral-ports-range` flag)."
msgstr ""
"3. En server utan NAT eller bakom obegränsad NAT, där inkommande UDP är "
"öppet för hela portintervallet från `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/"
"ip_local_port_range`, eller intervallet som anges med den valfria flaggan `-"
"ephemeral-ports-range`."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid ""
"If you need help to install and operate your Snowflake proxy, visit the [Tor "
"Forum](https://forum.torproject.org/tag/snowflake)."
msgstr ""
"Besök [Tor-forumet](https://forum.torproject.org/tag/snowflake) om du "
"behöver hjälp med att installera och driva Snowflake-proxyn."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid "Please choose your preferred platform below."
msgstr "Välj önskad plattform nedan."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid ""
"The only requirements are internet connectivity, however one of the main "
"advantages of standalone Snowflake proxies is that they can be installed on "
"servers and offer a higher bandwidth and more reliable option for users "
"behind restrictive NATs and firewalls."
msgstr ""
"Det enda kravet är internetanslutning. En av de främsta fördelarna med "
"fristående Snowflake-proxyer är dock att de kan installeras på servrar och "
"ge högre bandbredd och en tillförlitligare lösning för användare bakom "
"restriktiv NAT och restriktiva brandväggar."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid ""
"The properties you are looking for are address-independent mapping and "
"either address-independent or address-dependent filtering)"
msgstr ""
"Egenskaperna du söker är adressoberoende mappning och antingen "
"adressoberoende eller adressberoende filtrering.)"

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid "There are several ways to setup and run a standalone snowflake proxy."
msgstr ""
"Det finns flera sätt att konfigurera och köra en fristående Snowflake-proxy."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid "Therefore, we especially recommend:"
msgstr "Därför rekommenderar vi särskilt:"

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid ""
"This guide will help you set up a standalone Snowflake proxy to help "
"censored users connect to the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Den här vägledningen hjälper dig att konfigurera en fristående Snowflake-"
"proxy så att censurerade användare kan ansluta till Tor-nätverket."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
msgid "How to run a standalone Snowflake proxy"
msgstr "Så kör du en fristående Snowflake-proxy"

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/
