"Snowflake proxy can be easily installed as a package on Debian-based systems "
"(Debian 12 - bookworm)."
msgstr ""
"Snowflake-proxyn kan enkelt installeras som ett paket på Debian-baserade "
"system, exempelvis Debian 12 Bookworm."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/debian/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/debian/
