"This guide will walk you through the installation, operation, and "
"maintenance of [Snowflake](https://snowflake.torproject.org) proxy to "
"contribute to the Tor Project's anti-censorship efforts."
msgstr ""
"Den här vägledningen beskriver hur du installerar, driver och underhåller en "
"[Snowflake](https://snowflake.torproject.org)-proxy och bidrar till The Tor "
"Projects arbete mot censur."

#: content/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/debian/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/relay/setup/snowflake/standalone/debian/
