msgid "Training"
msgstr "Utbildning"

#: content/training/best-practices/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/best-practices/
msgid "Training Best Practices"
msgstr "Bästa praxis för utbildningar"

#: content/training/code-of-conduct/contents.lr:page.body
#: content/training/code-of-conduct/contents.lr:page.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/code-of-conduct/
msgid "Code of Conduct for Trainers"
msgstr "Uppförandekod för utbildare"

#: content/training/code-of-conduct/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/code-of-conduct/
msgid ""
"The Tor Project is committed to fostering an inclusive environment and "
"community. Tor is a place where people should feel safe to engage, share "
"their point of view, and participate."
msgstr ""
"The Tor Project arbetar för en inkluderande miljö och gemenskap. Tor ska "
"vara en plats där människor känner sig trygga att engagera sig, dela sina "
"åsikter och delta."

#: content/training/code-of-conduct/contents.lr:page.cta
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/code-of-conduct/
msgid "Code of Conduct"
msgstr "Uppförandekod"

#: content/training/code-of-conduct/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/code-of-conduct/
msgid "Foster a safe, engaging environment."
msgstr "Skapa en trygg och engagerande miljö."

#: content/training/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/
msgid ""
"Are you a Tor trainer or interested in becoming one? Looking for resources "
"to help your community learn the most about Tor? We've got you covered."
msgstr ""
"Är du Tor-utbildare eller intresserad av att bli det? Söker du resurser som "
"hjälper gemenskapen att lära sig så mycket som möjligt om Tor? Här finns det "
"du behöver."

#: content/training/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/
msgid ""
"For some users with serious threat models, teaching Tor and other privacy "
"tools can be risky if not done with care."
msgstr ""
"För vissa användare med allvarliga hotmodeller kan undervisning om Tor och "
"andra integritetsverktyg innebära risker om den inte genomförs varsamt."

#: content/training/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/
msgid ""
"If this describes your community, or if you're not sure, please [contact our "
"Community Team](https://lists.torproject.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/tor-"
"community-team) for more help."
msgstr ""
"Om detta beskriver din gemenskap eller om du är osäker kan du [kontakta vårt "
"gemenskapsteam](https://lists.torproject.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/tor-"
"community-team) för mer hjälp."

#: content/training/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/
msgid "We want to teach the world about Tor. Can you help?"
msgstr "Vi vill lära världen om Tor. Kan du hjälpa till?"

#: content/training/contents.lr:page.cta
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/
msgid "Check our resources"
msgstr "Se våra resurser"

#: content/training/contents.lr:page.subtitle
#: content/training/resources/contents.lr:community-resources.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/resources/
msgid ""
"Do you teach your community about using Tor? These resources are for you."
msgstr ""
"Lär du din gemenskap att använda Tor? Då är resurserna avsedda för dig."

#: content/training/digital-security-guides/contents.lr:community-resources.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/digital-security-guides/
msgid ""
"These guides are explainers on topics related to Tor and digital security "
"more broadly including: Web fingerprinting, Internet censorship, Tails, "
"metadata security, and more! You can make use of these guides for self-"
"learning or during trainings as reading resources. For training material, "
"please visit [our training resources page](https://community.torproject.org/"
"training/resources/)"
msgstr ""
"Vägledningarna förklarar ämnen som rör Tor och digital säkerhet i bredare "
"bemärkelse, bland annat webbläsarfingeravtryck, internetcensur, Tails och "
"metadatasäkerhet. Du kan använda dem för självstudier eller som läsmaterial "
"under utbildningar. Utbildningsmaterial finns på [vår sida med "
"utbildningsresurser](https://community.torproject.org/training/resources/)."

#: content/training/digital-security-guides/contents.lr:community-resources.cta
#: content/training/resources/contents.lr:community-resources.cta
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/digital-security-guides/
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/resources/
msgid "Check out our resources"
msgstr "Utforska våra resurser"

#: content/training/digital-security-guides/contents.lr:community-resources.section
#: content/training/digital-security-guides/contents.lr:community-resources.title
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/digital-security-guides/
msgid "Digital Security Guides"
msgstr "Vägledningar om digital säkerhet"

#: content/training/digital-security-guides/contents.lr:community-resources.subtitle
#: https://community.torproject.org/training/digital-security-guides/
msgid ""
"A set of short guides on topics related to Tor and digital security more "
"broadly, to share during trainings or for personal learning."
msgstr ""
"En uppsättning korta vägledningar om Tor och digital säkerhet i bredare "
"bemärkelse, för utbildningar eller egna studier."

