#: content/user-research/personas/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/user-research/personas/
msgid ""
"Following a series of digital security workshops and usability testing "
"sessions in Brazil, Ecuador & Mexico from 2021–2023, we consolidated much of "
"what we learned into a further two personas:"
msgstr ""
"Efter en serie workshoppar om digital säkerhet och användbarhetstester i "
"Brasilien, Ecuador och Mexiko 2021–2023 sammanställde vi mycket av det vi "
"lärde oss i ytterligare två personor:"

#: content/user-research/personas/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/user-research/personas/
msgid ""
"However as of 2023, some of the information presented in them (e.g. the "
"social/political context and state of censorship in some countries) may be "
"out of date."
msgstr ""
"Från och med 2023 kan dock en del av informationen i dem, till exempel den "
"sociala och politiska situationen och censurläget i vissa länder, vara "
"inaktuell."

#: content/user-research/personas/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/user-research/personas/
msgid ""
"Ifeanyi, the resolute reporter: [View on Gitlab](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/research/-/blob/master/personas/ifeanyi.pdf) · "
"[Download PDF](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/research/-/raw/master/"
"personas/ifeanyi.pdf)"
msgstr ""
"Ifeanyi, den beslutsamma reportern: [Visa på GitLab](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/research/-/blob/master/personas/ifeanyi.pdf) · "
"[Hämta PDF](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/research/-/raw/master/"
"personas/ifeanyi.pdf)"

#: content/user-research/personas/contents.lr:page.body
#: https://community.torproject.org/user-research/personas/
msgid ""
"In 2020, as part of a wider project on censorship circumvention, we created "
"two additional personas set in the context of contemporary internet "
"censorship events in West Africa:"
msgstr ""
"År 2020 skapade vi, som en del av ett större projekt om att kringgå censur, "
"ytterligare två personor med utgångspunkt i samtida internetcensur i "
"Västafrika:"

